verse	1	8	12	And he stayed yet other seven days; and sent forth the dove; which returned not again unto him any more.
verse	1	8	13	@@And it came to pass in the six hundredth and first year, in the first @9month,@7 the first @9day@7 of the month, the waters were dried up from off the earth: and Noah removed the covering of the ark, and looked, and, behold, the face of the ground was dry.
verse	1	8	14	And in the second month, on the seven and twentieth day of the month, was the earth dried.
