verse	1	9	10	@@And with every living creature that @9is@7 with you, of the fowl, of the cattle, and of every beast of the earth with you; from all that go out of the ark, to every beast of the earth.
verse	1	9	11	And I will establish my covenant with you; neither shall all flesh be cut off any more by the waters of a flood; neither shall there any more be a flood to destroy the earth.
verse	1	9	12	@@And God said, This @9is@7 the token of the covenant which I make between me and you and every living creature that @9is@7 with you, for perpetual generations:
