verse	1	32	1	And Jacob went on his way, and the angels of God met him.
verse	1	32	2	@@And when Jacob saw them, he said, This @9is@7 God's host: and he called the name of that place Mahanaim.
verse	1	32	3	And Jacob sent messengers before him to Esau his brother unto the land of Seir, the country of Edom.
