verse	1	32	7	@@Then Jacob was greatly afraid and distressed: and he divided the people that @9was@7 with him, and the flocks, and herds, and the camels, into two bands;
verse	1	32	8	And said, If Esau come to the one company, and smite it, then the other company which is left shall escape.
