verse	1	34	13	And the sons of Jacob answered Shechem and Hamor his father deceitfully, and said, because he had defiled Dinah their sister:
verse	1	34	14	@@And they said unto them, We cannot do this thing, to give our sister to one that is uncircumcised; for that @9were@7 a reproach unto us:
verse	1	34	15	@@But in this will we consent unto you: If ye will be as we @9be,@7 that every male of you be circumcised;
