verse	1	34	18	And their words pleased Hamor, and Shechem Hamor's son.
verse	1	34	19	@@And the young man deferred not to do the thing, because he had delight in Jacob's daughter: and he @9was@7 more honourable than all the house of his father.
verse	1	34	20	And Hamor and Shechem his son came unto the gate of their city, and communed with the men of their city, saying,
verse	1	34	21	@@These men @9are@7 peaceable with us; therefore let them dwell in the land, and trade therein; for the land, behold, @9it is@7 large enough for them; let us take their daughters to us for wives, and let us give them our daughters.
verse	1	34	22	@@Only herein will the men consent unto us for to dwell with us, to be one people, if every male among us be circumcised, as they @9are@7 circumcised.
