verse	1	36	38	And Saul died, and Baalhanan the son of Achbor reigned in his stead.
verse	1	36	39	@@And Baalhanan the son of Achbor died, and Hadar reigned in his stead: and the name of his city @9was@7 Pau; and his wife's name @9was@7 Mehetabel, the daughter of Matred, the daughter of Mezahab.
verse	1	36	40	@@And these @9are@7 the names of the dukes @9that came@7 of Esau, according to their families, after their places, by their names; duke Timnah, duke Alvah, duke Jetheth,
