verse	1	41	37	And the thing was good in the eyes of Pharaoh, and in the eyes of all his servants.
verse	1	41	38	@@And Pharaoh said unto his servants, Can we find @9such a one@7 as this @9is,@7 a man in whom the Spirit of God is?
verse	1	41	39	@@And Pharaoh said unto Joseph, Forasmuch as God hath shewed thee all this, @9there is@7 none so discreet and wise as thou @9art: @7
