verse	1	41	41	And Pharaoh said unto Joseph, See, I have set thee over all the land of Egypt.
verse	1	41	42	And Pharaoh took off his ring from his hand, and put it upon Joseph's hand, and arrayed him in vestures of fine linen, and put a gold chain about his neck;
verse	1	41	43	@@And he made him to ride in the second chariot which he had; and they cried before him, Bow the knee: and he made him @9ruler@7 over all the land of Egypt.
verse	1	41	44	@@And Pharaoh said unto Joseph, I @9am@7 Pharaoh, and without thee shall no man lift up his hand or foot in all the land of Egypt.
verse	1	41	45	@@And Pharaoh called Joseph's name Zaphnathpaaneah; and he gave him to wife Asenath the daughter of Poti-pherah priest of On. And Joseph went out over @9all@7 the land of Egypt.
