verse	1	45	20	@@Also regard not your stuff; for the good of all the land of Egypt @9is@7 yours.
verse	1	45	21	And the children of Israel did so: and Joseph gave them wagons, according to the commandment of Pharaoh, and gave them provision for the way.
verse	1	45	22	@@To all of them he gave each man changes of raiment; but to Benjamin he gave three hundred @9pieces@7 of silver, and five changes of raiment.
verse	1	45	23	@@And to his father he sent after this @9manner;@7 ten asses laden with the good things of Egypt, and ten she asses laden with corn and bread and meat for his father by the way.
