verse	1	46	30	@@And Israel said unto Joseph, Now let me die, since I have seen thy face, because thou @9art@7 yet alive.
verse	1	46	31	@@And Joseph said unto his brethren, and unto his father's house, I will go up, and shew Pharaoh, and say unto him, My brethren, and my father's house, which @9were@7 in the land of Canaan, are come unto me;
