verse	1	49	10	@@The sceptre shall not depart from Judah, nor a lawgiver from between his feet, until Shiloh come; and unto him @9shall@7 the gathering of the people @9be. @7
verse	1	49	11	Binding his foal unto the vine, and his ass's colt unto the choice vine; he washed his garments in wine, and his clothes in the blood of grapes:
