verse	1	49	13	@@Zebulun shall dwell at the haven of the sea; and he @9shall be@7 for an haven of ships; and his border @9shall be@7 unto Zidon.
verse	1	49	14	@@Issachar @9is@7 a strong ass couching down between two burdens:
verse	1	49	15	@@And he saw that rest @9was@7 good, and the land that @9it was@7 pleasant; and bowed his shoulder to bear, and became a servant unto tribute.
