verse	1	49	28	@@All these @9are@7 the twelve tribes of Israel: and this @9is it@7 that their father spake unto them, and blessed them; every one according to his blessing he blessed them.
verse	1	49	29	@@And he charged them, and said unto them, I am to be gathered unto my people: bury me with my fathers in the cave that @9is@7 in the field of Ephron the Hittite,
