verse	1	50	10	@@And they came to the threshingfloor of Atad, which @9is@7 beyond Jordan, and there they mourned with a great and very sore lamentation: and he made a mourning for his father seven days.
verse	1	50	11	@@And when the inhabitants of the land, the Canaanites, saw the mourning in the floor of Atad, they said, This @9is@7 a grievous mourning to the Egyptians: wherefore the name of it was called Abelmizraim, which @9is@7 beyond Jordan.
verse	1	50	12	And his sons did unto him according as he commanded them:
