verse	1	50	18	@@And his brethren also went and fell down before his face; and they said, Behold, we @9be@7 thy servants.
verse	1	50	19	@@And Joseph said unto them, Fear not: for @9am@7 I in the place of God?
verse	1	50	20	@@But as for you, ye thought evil against me; @9but@7 God meant it unto good, to bring to pass, as @9it is@7 this day, to save much people alive.
verse	1	50	21	Now therefore fear ye not: I will nourish you, and your little ones. And he comforted them, and spake kindly unto them.
