verse	1	50	26	@@So Joseph died, @9being@7 an hundred and ten years old: and they embalmed him, and he was put in a coffin in Egypt.
verse	2	1	1	@@Now these @9are@7 the names of the children of Israel, which came into Egypt; every man and his household came with Jacob.
verse	2	1	2	Reuben, Simeon, Levi, and Judah,
