verse	2	1	8	Now there arose up a new king over Egypt, which knew not Joseph.
verse	2	1	9	@@And he said unto his people, Behold, the people of the children of Israel @9are@7 more and mightier than we:
verse	2	1	10	@@Come on, let us deal wisely with them; lest they multiply, and it come to pass, that, when there falleth out any war, they join also unto our enemies, and fight against us, and @9so@7 get them up out of the land.
verse	2	1	11	Therefore they did set over them taskmasters to afflict them with their burdens. And they built for Pharaoh treasure cities, Pithom and Raamses.
