verse	2	3	22	@@But every woman shall borrow of her neighbour, and of her that sojourneth in her house, jewels of silver, and jewels of gold, and raiment: and ye shall put @9them@7 upon your sons, and upon your daughters; and ye shall spoil the Egyptians.
verse	2	4	1	And Moses answered and said, But, behold, they will not believe me, nor hearken unto my voice: for they will say, The LORD hath not appeared unto thee.
