verse	2	4	9	@@And it shall come to pass, if they will not believe also these two signs, neither hearken unto thy voice, that thou shalt take of the water of the river, and pour @9it@7 upon the dry @9land:@7 and the water which thou takest out of the river shall become blood upon the dry @9land.@7
verse	2	4	10	@@And Moses said unto the LORD, O my Lord, I @9am@7 not eloquent, neither heretofore, nor since thou hast spoken unto thy servant: but I @9am@7 slow of speech, and of a slow tongue.
