verse	2	14	19	And the angel of God, which went before the camp of Israel, removed and went behind them; and the pillar of the cloud went from before their face, and stood behind them:
verse	2	14	20	@@And it came between the camp of the Egyptians and the camp of Israel; and it was a cloud and darkness @9to them,@7 but it gave light by night @9to these:@7 so that the one came not near the other all the night.
verse	2	14	21	@@And Moses stretched out his hand over the sea; and the LORD caused the sea to go @9back@7 by a strong east wind all that night, and made the sea dry @9land,@7 and the waters were divided.
