verse	2	15	2	@@The LORD @9is@7 my strength and song, and he is become my salvation: he @9is@7 my God, and I will prepare him an habitation; my father's God, and I will exalt him.
verse	2	15	3	@@The LORD @9is@7 a man of war: the LORD @9is@7 his name.
