verse	2	17	12	@@But Moses' hands @9were@7 heavy; and they took a stone, and put @9it@7 under him, and he sat thereon; and Aaron and Hur stayed up his hands, the one on the one side, and the other on the other side; and his hands were steady until the going down of the sun.
verse	2	17	13	And Joshua discomfited Amalek and his people with the edge of the sword.
verse	2	17	14	@@And the LORD said unto Moses, Write this @9for@7 a memorial in a book, and rehearse @9it@7 in the ears of Joshua: for I will utterly put out the remembrance of Amalek from under heaven.
