verse	2	17	16	@@For he said, Because the LORD hath sworn @9that@7 the LORD @9will have@7 war with Amalek from generation to generation.
verse	2	18	1	@@When Jethro, the priest of Midian, Moses' father in law, heard of all that God had done for Moses, and for Israel his people, @9and@7 that the LORD had brought Israel out of Egypt;
