verse	2	24	14	@@And he said unto the elders, Tarry ye here for us, until we come again unto you: and, behold, Aaron and Hur @9are@7 with you: if any man have any matters to do, let him come unto them.
verse	2	24	15	And Moses went up into the mount, and a cloud covered the mount.
