verse	2	25	10	@@And they shall make an ark @9of@7 shittim wood: two cubits and a half @9shall be@7 the length thereof, and a cubit and a half the breadth thereof, and a cubit and a half the height thereof.
verse	2	25	11	And thou shalt overlay it with pure gold, within and without shalt thou overlay it, and shalt make upon it a crown of gold round about.
