verse	2	25	17	@@And thou shalt make a mercy seat @9of@7 pure gold: two cubits and a half @9shall be@7 the length thereof, and a cubit and a half the breadth thereof.
verse	2	25	18	@@And thou shalt make two cherubims @9of@7 gold, @9of@7 beaten work shalt thou make them, in the two ends of the mercy seat.
