verse	2	26	1	@@Moreover thou shalt make the tabernacle @9with@7 ten curtains @9of@7 fine twined linen, and blue, and purple, and scarlet: @9with@7 cherubims of cunning work shalt thou make them.
verse	2	26	2	@@The length of one curtain @9shall be@7 eight and twenty cubits, and the breadth of one curtain four cubits: and every one of the curtains shall have one measure.
verse	2	26	3	@@The five curtains shall be coupled together one to another; and @9other@7 five curtains @9shall be@7 coupled one to another.
verse	2	26	4	@@And thou shalt make loops of blue upon the edge of the one curtain from the selvedge in the coupling; and likewise shalt thou make in the uttermost edge of @9another@7 curtain, in the coupling of the second.
verse	2	26	5	Fifty loops shalt thou make in the one curtain, and fifty loops shalt thou make in the edge of the curtain that is in the coupling of the second; that the loops may take hold one of another.
