verse	2	26	8	@@The length of one curtain @9shall be@7 thirty cubits, and the breadth of one curtain four cubits: and the eleven curtains @9shall be all@7 of one measure.
verse	2	26	9	And thou shalt couple five curtains by themselves, and six curtains by themselves, and shalt double the sixth curtain in the forefront of the tabernacle.
verse	2	26	10	@@And thou shalt make fifty loops on the edge of the one curtain @9that is@7 outmost in the coupling, and fifty loops in the edge of the curtain which coupleth the second.
