verse	2	28	1	@@And take thou unto thee Aaron thy brother, and his sons with him, from among the children of Israel, that he may minister unto me in the priest's office, @9even@7 Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar, Aaron's sons.
