verse	2	28	11	@@With the work of an engraver in stone, @9like@7 the engravings of a signet, shalt thou engrave the two stones with the names of the children of Israel: thou shalt make them to be set in ouches of gold.
verse	2	28	12	@@And thou shalt put the two stones upon the shoulders of the ephod @9for@7 stones of memorial unto the children of Israel: and Aaron shall bear their names before the LORD upon his two shoulders for a memorial.
verse	2	28	13	@@And thou shalt make ouches @9of@7 gold;
