verse	2	28	15	@@And thou shalt make the breastplate of judgment with cunning work; after the work of the ephod thou shalt make it; @9of@7 gold, @9of@7 blue, and @9of@7 purple, and @9of@7 scarlet, and @9of@7 fine twined linen, shalt thou make it.
