verse	2	30	13	@@This they shall give, every one that passeth among them that are numbered, half a shekel after the shekel of the sanctuary: (a shekel @9is@7 twenty gerahs:) an half shekel @9shall be@7 the offering of the LORD.
verse	2	30	14	Every one that passeth among them that are numbered, from twenty years old and above, shall give an offering unto the LORD.
