verse	2	30	17	And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,
verse	2	30	18	@@Thou shalt also make a laver @9of@7 brass, and his foot @9also of@7 brass, to wash @9withal:@7 and thou shalt put it between the tabernacle of the congregation and the altar, and thou shalt put water therein.
