verse	2	30	23	@@Take thou also unto thee principal spices, of pure myrrh five hundred @9shekels,@7 and of sweet cinnamon half so much, @9even@7 two hundred and fifty @9shekels,@7 and of sweet calamus two hundred and fifty @9shekels, @7
