verse	2	30	29	And thou shalt sanctify them, that they may be most holy: whatsoever toucheth them shall be holy.
verse	2	30	30	@@And thou shalt anoint Aaron and his sons, and consecrate them, that @9they@7 may minister unto me in the priest's office.
verse	2	30	31	And thou shalt speak unto the children of Israel, saying, This shall be an holy anointing oil unto me throughout your generations.
verse	2	30	32	@@Upon man's flesh shall it not be poured, neither shall ye make @9any other@7 like it, after the composition of it: it @9is@7 holy, @9and@7 it shall be holy unto you.
