verse	2	31	4	To devise cunning works, to work in gold, and in silver, and in brass,
verse	2	31	5	@@And in cutting of stones, to set @9them,@7 and in carving of timber, to work in all manner of workmanship.
verse	2	31	6	And I, behold, I have given with him Aholiab, the son of Ahisamach, of the tribe of Dan: and in the hearts of all that are wise hearted I have put wisdom, that they may make all that I have commanded thee;
verse	2	31	7	@@The tabernacle of the congregation, and the ark of the testimony, and the mercy seat that @9is@7 thereupon, and all the furniture of the tabernacle,
