verse	2	34	1	@@And the LORD said unto Moses, Hew thee two tables of stone like unto the first: and I will write upon @9these@7 tables the words that were in the first tables, which thou brakest.
verse	2	34	2	And be ready in the morning, and come up in the morning unto mount Sinai, and present thyself there to me in the top of the mount.
