verse	2	34	19	@@All that openeth the matrix @9is@7 mine; and every firstling among thy cattle, @9whether@7 ox or sheep, @9that is male. @7
verse	2	34	20	@@But the firstling of an ass thou shalt redeem with a lamb: and if thou redeem @9him@7 not, then shalt thou break his neck. All the firstborn of thy sons thou shalt redeem. And none shall appear before me empty.
verse	2	34	21	Six days thou shalt work, but on the seventh day thou shalt rest: in earing time and in harvest thou shalt rest.
