verse	2	35	21	@@And they came, every one whose heart stirred him up, and every one whom his spirit made willing, @9and@7 they brought the LORD'S offering to the work of the tabernacle of the congregation, and for all his service, and for the holy garments.
verse	2	35	22	@@And they came, both men and women, as many as were willing hearted, @9and@7 brought bracelets, and earrings, and rings, and tablets, all jewels of gold: and every man that offered @9offered@7 an offering of gold unto the LORD.
