verse	2	36	3	@@And they received of Moses all the offering, which the children of Israel had brought for the work of the service of the sanctuary, to make it @9withal.@7 And they brought yet unto him free offerings every morning.
verse	2	36	4	And all the wise men, that wrought all the work of the sanctuary, came every man from his work which they made;
verse	2	36	5	And they spake unto Moses, saying, The people bring much more than enough for the service of the work, which the LORD commanded to make.
