verse	2	36	8	@@And every wise hearted man among them that wrought the work of the tabernacle made ten curtains @9of@7 fine twined linen, and blue, and purple, and scarlet: @9with@7 cherubims of cunning work made he them.
verse	2	36	9	@@The length of one curtain @9was@7 twenty and eight cubits, and the breadth of one curtain four cubits: the curtains @9were@7 all of one size.
