verse	2	36	18	@@And he made fifty taches @9of@7 brass to couple the tent together, that it might be one.
verse	2	36	19	@@And he made a covering for the tent @9of@7 rams' skins dyed red, and a covering @9of@7 badgers' skins above @9that.@7
