verse	3	11	1	And the LORD spake unto Moses and to Aaron, saying unto them,
verse	3	11	2	@@Speak unto the children of Israel, saying, These @9are@7 the beasts which ye shall eat among all the beasts that @9are@7 on the earth.
verse	3	11	3	@@Whatsoever parteth the hoof, and is clovenfooted, @9and@7 cheweth the cud, among the beasts, that shall ye eat.
verse	3	11	4	@@Nevertheless these shall ye not eat of them that chew the cud, or of them that divide the hoof: @9as@7 the camel, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he is unclean unto you.
verse	3	11	5	@@And the coney, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he @9is@7 unclean unto you.
verse	3	11	6	@@And the hare, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he @9is@7 unclean unto you.
verse	3	11	7	@@And the swine, though he divide the hoof, and be clovenfooted, yet he cheweth not the cud; he @9is@7 unclean to you.
verse	3	11	8	@@Of their flesh shall ye not eat, and their carcase shall ye not touch; they @9are@7 unclean to you.
verse	3	11	9	@@These shall ye eat of all that @9are@7 in the waters: whatsoever hath fins and scales in the waters, in the seas, and in the rivers, them shall ye eat.
verse	3	11	10	@@And all that have not fins and scales in the seas, and in the rivers, of all that move in the waters, and of any living thing which @9is@7 in the waters, they @9shall be@7 an abomination unto you:
verse	3	11	11	They shall be even an abomination unto you; ye shall not eat of their flesh, but ye shall have their carcases in abomination.
verse	3	11	12	@@Whatsoever hath no fins nor scales in the waters, that @9shall be@7 an abomination unto you.
verse	3	11	13	@@And these @9are they which ye@7 shall have in abomination among the fowls; they shall not be eaten, they @9are@7 an abomination: the eagle, and the ossifrage, and the ospray,
verse	3	11	14	And the vulture, and the kite after his kind;
