verse	3	11	19	And the stork, the heron after her kind, and the lapwing, and the bat.
verse	3	11	20	@@All fowls that creep, going upon @9all@7 four, @9shall be@7 an abomination unto you.
verse	3	11	21	@@Yet these may ye eat of every flying creeping thing that goeth upon @9all@7 four, which have legs above their feet, to leap withal upon the earth;
