verse	4	11	35	@@@9And@7 the people journeyed from Kibrothhattaavah unto Hazeroth; and abode at Hazeroth.
verse	4	12	1	And Miriam and Aaron spake against Moses because of the Ethiopian woman whom he had married: for he had married an Ethiopian woman.
verse	4	12	2	@@And they said, Hath the LORD indeed spoken only by Moses? hath he not spoken also by us? And the LORD heard @9it. @7
verse	4	12	3	@@(Now the man Moses @9was@7 very meek, above all the men which @9were@7 upon the face of the earth.)
verse	4	12	4	And the LORD spake suddenly unto Moses, and unto Aaron, and unto Miriam, Come out ye three unto the tabernacle of the congregation. And they three came out.
verse	4	12	5	And the LORD came down in the pillar of the cloud, and stood in the door of the tabernacle, and called Aaron and Miriam: and they both came forth.
verse	4	12	6	@@And he said, Hear now my words: If there be a prophet among you, @9I@7 the LORD will make myself known unto him in a vision, @9and@7 will speak unto him in a dream.
