verse	4	12	13	And Moses cried unto the LORD, saying, Heal her now, O God, I beseech thee.
verse	4	12	14	@@And the LORD said unto Moses, If her father had but spit in her face, should she not be ashamed seven days? let her be shut out from the camp seven days, and after that let her be received in @9again. @7
verse	4	12	15	@@And Miriam was shut out from the camp seven days: and the people journeyed not till Miriam was brought in @9again. @7
verse	4	12	16	And afterward the people removed from Hazeroth, and pitched in the wilderness of Paran.
verse	4	13	1	And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,
verse	4	13	2	Send thou men, that they may search the land of Canaan, which I give unto the children of Israel: of every tribe of their fathers shall ye send a man, every one a ruler among them.
verse	4	13	3	@@And Moses by the commandment of the LORD sent them from the wilderness of Paran: all those men @9were@7 heads of the children of Israel.
verse	4	13	4	@@And these @9were@7 their names: of the tribe of Reuben, Shammua the son of Zaccur.
verse	4	13	5	Of the tribe of Simeon, Shaphat the son of Hori.
verse	4	13	6	Of the tribe of Judah, Caleb the son of Jephunneh.
verse	4	13	7	Of the tribe of Issachar, Igal the son of Joseph.
verse	4	13	8	Of the tribe of Ephraim, Oshea the son of Nun.
verse	4	13	9	Of the tribe of Benjamin, Palti the son of Raphu.
verse	4	13	10	Of the tribe of Zebulun, Gaddiel the son of Sodi.
verse	4	13	11	Of the tribe of Joseph, namely, of the tribe of Manasseh, Gaddi the son of Susi.
