verse	4	13	16	@@These @9are@7 the names of the men which Moses sent to spy out the land. And Moses called Oshea the son of Nun Jehoshua.
verse	4	13	17	@@And Moses sent them to spy out the land of Canaan, and said unto them, Get you up this @9way@7 southward, and go up into the mountain:
