verse	4	13	20	@@And what the land @9is,@7 whether it @9be@7 fat or lean, whether there be wood therein, or not. And be ye of good courage, and bring of the fruit of the land. Now the time @9was@7 the time of the firstripe grapes.
verse	4	13	21	So they went up, and searched the land from the wilderness of Zin unto Rehob, as men come to Hamath.
