verse	4	13	27	@@And they told him, and said, We came unto the land whither thou sentest us, and surely it floweth with milk and honey; and this @9is@7 the fruit of it.
verse	4	13	28	@@Nevertheless the people @9be@7 strong that dwell in the land, and the cities @9are@7 walled, @9and@7 very great: and moreover we saw the children of Anak there.
