verse	4	26	26	@@@9Of@7 the sons of Zebulun after their families: of Sered, the family of the Sardites: of Elon, the family of the Elonites: of Jahleel, the family of the Jahleelites.
verse	4	26	27	@@These @9are@7 the families of the Zebulunites according to those that were numbered of them, threescore thousand and five hundred.
