verse	4	28	27	But ye shall offer the burnt offering for a sweet savour unto the LORD; two young bullocks, one ram, seven lambs of the first year;
verse	4	28	28	And their meat offering of flour mingled with oil, three tenth deals unto one bullock, two tenth deals unto one ram,
verse	4	28	29	A several tenth deal unto one lamb, throughout the seven lambs;
