verse	4	28	31	@@Ye shall offer @9them@7 beside the continual burnt offering, and his meat offering, (they shall be unto you without blemish) and their drink offerings.
verse	4	29	1	@@And in the seventh month, on the first @9day@7 of the month, ye shall have an holy convocation; ye shall do no servile work: it is a day of blowing the trumpets unto you.
verse	4	29	2	@@And ye shall offer a burnt offering for a sweet savour unto the LORD; one young bullock, one ram, @9and@7 seven lambs of the first year without blemish:
verse	4	29	3	@@And their meat offering @9shall be of@7 flour mingled with oil, three tenth deals for a bullock, @9and@7 two tenth deals for a ram,
