verse	4	29	7	@@And ye shall have on the tenth @9day@7 of this seventh month an holy convocation; and ye shall afflict your souls: ye shall not do any work @9therein: @7
verse	4	29	8	@@But ye shall offer a burnt offering unto the LORD @9for@7 a sweet savour; one young bullock, one ram, @9and@7 seven lambs of the first year; they shall be unto you without blemish:
verse	4	29	9	@@And their meat offering @9shall be of@7 flour mingled with oil, three tenth deals to a bullock, @9and@7 two tenth deals to one ram,
