verse	4	29	13	@@And ye shall offer a burnt offering, a sacrifice made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the LORD; thirteen young bullocks, two rams, @9and@7 fourteen lambs of the first year; they shall be without blemish:
verse	4	29	14	@@And their meat offering @9shall be of@7 flour mingled with oil, three tenth deals unto every bullock of the thirteen bullocks, two tenth deals to each ram of the two rams,
