verse	4	29	16	@@And one kid of the goats @9for@7 a sin offering; beside the continual burnt offering, his meat offering, and his drink offering.
verse	4	29	17	@@And on the second day @9ye shall offer@7 twelve young bullocks, two rams, fourteen lambs of the first year without spot:
