verse	5	28	31	@@Thine ox @9shall be@7 slain before thine eyes, and thou shalt not eat thereof: thine ass @9shall be@7 violently taken away from before thy face, and shall not be restored to thee: thy sheep @9shall be@7 given unto thine enemies, and thou shalt have none to rescue @9them. @7
verse	5	28	32	@@Thy sons and thy daughters @9shall be@7 given unto another people, and thine eyes shall look, and fail @9with longing@7 for them all the day long: and @9there shall be@7 no might in thine hand.
