verse	5	30	10	@@If thou shalt hearken unto the voice of the LORD thy God, to keep his commandments and his statutes which are written in this book of the law, @9and@7 if thou turn unto the LORD thy God with all thine heart, and with all thy soul.
verse	5	30	11	@@For this commandment which I command thee this day, it @9is@7 not hidden from thee, neither @9is@7 it far off.
