verse	6	12	7	@@And these @9are@7 the kings of the country which Joshua and the children of Israel smote on this side Jordan on the west, from Baalgad in the valley of Lebanon even unto the mount Halak, that goeth up to Seir; which Joshua gave unto the tribes of Israel @9for@7 a possession according to their divisions;
