verse	6	15	8	@@And the border went up by the valley of the son of Hinnom unto the south side of the Jebusite; the same @9is@7 Jerusalem: and the border went up to the top of the mountain that @9lieth@7 before the valley of Hinnom westward, which @9is@7 at the end of the valley of the giants northward:
