verse	6	18	20	@@And Jordan was the border of it on the east side. This @9was@7 the inheritance of the children of Benjamin, by the coasts thereof round about, according to their families.
verse	6	18	21	Now the cities of the tribe of the children of Benjamin according to their families were Jericho, and Bethhoglah, and the valley of Keziz,
