verse	7	12	10	Then died Ibzan, and was buried at Bethlehem.
verse	7	12	11	And after him Elon, a Zebulonite, judged Israel; and he judged Israel ten years.
verse	7	12	12	And Elon the Zebulonite died, and was buried in Aijalon in the country of Zebulun.
verse	7	12	13	And after him Abdon the son of Hillel, a Pirathonite, judged Israel.
