verse	9	14	4	@@And between the passages, by which Jonathan sought to go over unto the Philistines' garrison, @9there was@7 a sharp rock on the one side, and a sharp rock on the other side: and the name of the one @9was@7 Bozez, and the name of the other Seneh.
