verse	9	20	3	@@And David sware moreover, and said, Thy father certainly knoweth that I have found grace in thine eyes; and he saith, Let not Jonathan know this, lest he be grieved: but truly @9as@7 the LORD liveth, and @9as@7 thy soul liveth, @9there is@7 but a step between me and death.
