verse	9	22	2	@@And every one @9that was@7 in distress, and every one that @9was@7 in debt, and every one @9that was@7 discontented, gathered themselves unto him; and he became a captain over them: and there were with him about four hundred men.
verse	9	22	3	@@And David went thence to Mizpeh of Moab: and he said unto the king of Moab, Let my father and my mother, I pray thee, come forth, @9and be@7 with you, till I know what God will do for me.
