verse	9	25	7	And now I have heard that thou hast shearers: now thy shepherds which were with us, we hurt them not, neither was there ought missing unto them, all the while they were in Carmel.
verse	9	25	8	Ask thy young men, and they will shew thee. Wherefore let the young men find favour in thine eyes: for we come in a good day: give, I pray thee, whatsoever cometh to thine hand unto thy servants, and to thy son David.
verse	9	25	9	And when David's young men came, they spake to Nabal according to all those words in the name of David, and ceased.
verse	9	25	10	@@And Nabal answered David's servants, and said, Who @9is@7 David? and who @9is@7 the son of Jesse? there be many servants now a days that break away every man from his master.
