verse	9	26	1	@@And the Ziphites came unto Saul to Gibeah, saying, Doth not David hide himself in the hill of Hachilah, @9which is@7 before Jeshimon?
verse	9	26	2	Then Saul arose, and went down to the wilderness of Ziph, having three thousand chosen men of Israel with him, to seek David in the wilderness of Ziph.
