verse	9	31	7	@@And when the men of Israel that @9were@7 on the other side of the valley, and @9they@7 that @9were@7 on the other side Jordan, saw that the men of Israel fled, and that Saul and his sons were dead, they forsook the cities, and fled; and the Philistines came and dwelt in them.
verse	9	31	8	And it came to pass on the morrow, when the Philistines came to strip the slain, that they found Saul and his three sons fallen in mount Gilboa.
verse	9	31	9	@@And they cut off his head, and stripped off his armour, and sent into the land of the Philistines round about, to publish @9it in@7 the house of their idols, and among the people.
verse	9	31	10	And they put his armour in the house of Ashtaroth: and they fastened his body to the wall of Bethshan.
