verse	10	2	1	And it came to pass after this, that David enquired of the LORD, saying, Shall I go up into any of the cities of Judah? And the LORD said unto him, Go up. And David said, Whither shall I go up? And he said, Unto Hebron.
verse	10	2	2	So David went up thither, and his two wives also, Ahinoam the Jezreelitess, and Abigail Nabal's wife the Carmelite.
verse	10	2	3	@@And his men that @9were@7 with him did David bring up, every man with his household: and they dwelt in the cities of Hebron.
verse	10	2	4	@@And the men of Judah came, and there they anointed David king over the house of Judah. And they told David, saying, @9That@7 the men of  Jabeshgilead @9were they@7 that buried Saul.
verse	10	2	5	@@And David sent messengers unto the men of  Jabeshgilead, and said unto them, Blessed @9be@7 ye of the LORD, that ye have shewed this kindness unto your lord, @9even@7 unto Saul, and have buried him.
