verse	10	2	8	But Abner the son of Ner, captain of Saul's host, took Ishbosheth the son of Saul, and brought him over to Mahanaim;
verse	10	2	9	And made him king over Gilead, and over the Ashurites, and over Jezreel, and over Ephraim, and over Benjamin, and over all Israel.
verse	10	2	10	@@Ishbosheth Saul's son @9was@7 forty years old when he began to reign over Israel, and reigned two years. But the house of Judah followed David.
