verse	10	2	23	@@Howbeit he refused to turn aside: wherefore Abner with the hinder end of the spear smote him under the fifth @9rib,@7 that the spear came out behind him; and he fell down there, and died in the same place: and it came to pass, @9that@7 as many as came to the place where Asahel fell down and died stood still.
verse	10	2	24	@@Joab also and Abishai pursued after Abner: and the sun went down when they were come to the hill of Ammah, that @9lieth@7 before Giah by the way of the wilderness of Gibeon.
verse	10	2	25	And the children of Benjamin gathered themselves together after Abner, and became one troop, and stood on the top of an hill.
