verse	10	3	7	@@And Saul had a concubine, whose name @9was@7 Rizpah, the daughter of Aiah: and @9Ishbosheth@7 said to Abner, Wherefore hast thou gone in unto my father's concubine?
verse	10	3	8	@@Then was Abner very wroth for the words of Ishbosheth, and said, @9Am@7 I a dog's head, which against Judah do shew kindness this day unto the house of Saul thy father, to his brethren, and to his friends, and have not delivered thee into the hand of David, that thou chargest me to day with a fault concerning this woman?
verse	10	3	9	So do God to Abner, and more also, except, as the LORD hath sworn to David, even so I do to him;
