verse	10	3	12	@@And Abner sent messengers to David on his behalf, saying, Whose @9is@7 the land? saying @9also,@7 Make thy league with me, and, behold, my hand @9shall be@7 with thee, to bring about all Israel unto thee.
verse	10	3	13	And he said, Well; I will make a league with thee: but one thing I require of thee, that is, Thou shalt not see my face, except thou first bring Michal Saul's daughter, when thou comest to see my face.
