verse	10	3	21	And Abner said unto David, I will arise and go, and will gather all Israel unto my lord the king, that they may make a league with thee, and that thou mayest reign over all that thine heart desireth. And David sent Abner away; and he went in peace.
verse	10	3	22	@@And, behold, the servants of David and Joab came from @9pursuing@7 a troop, and brought in a great spoil with them: but Abner @9was@7 not with David in Hebron; for he had sent him away, and he was gone in peace.
