verse	10	13	32	@@And Jonadab, the son of Shimeah David's brother, answered and said, Let not my lord suppose @9that@7 they have slain all the young men the king's sons; for Amnon only is dead: for by the appointment of Absalom this hath been determined from the day that he forced his sister Tamar.
verse	10	13	33	Now therefore let not my lord the king take the thing to his heart, to think that all the king's sons are dead: for Amnon only is dead.
