verse	10	14	31	@@Then Joab arose, and came to Absalom unto @9his@7 house, and said unto him, Wherefore have thy servants set my field on fire?
verse	10	14	32	@@And Absalom answered Joab, Behold, I sent unto thee, saying, Come hither, that I may send thee to the king, to say, Wherefore am I come from Geshur? @9it had been@7 good for me @9to have been@7 there still: now therefore let me see the king's face; and if there be @9any@7 iniquity in me, let him kill me.
verse	10	14	33	So Joab came to the king, and told him: and when he had called for Absalom, he came to the king, and bowed himself on his face to the ground before the king: and the king kissed Absalom.
verse	10	15	1	And it came to pass after this, that Absalom prepared him chariots and horses, and fifty men to run before him.
verse	10	15	2	@@And Absalom rose up early, and stood beside the way of the gate: and it was so, that when any man that had a controversy came to the king for judgment, then Absalom called unto him, and said, Of what city @9art@7 thou? And he said, Thy servant is of one of the tribes of Israel.
