verse	10	15	12	@@And Absalom sent for Ahithophel the Gilonite, David's counsellor, from his city, @9even@7 from Giloh, while he offered sacrifices. And the conspiracy was strong; for the people increased continually with Absalom.
verse	10	15	13	And there came a messenger to David, saying, The hearts of the men of Israel are after Absalom.
verse	10	15	14	@@And David said unto all his servants that @9were@7 with him at Jerusalem, Arise, and let us flee; for we shall not @9else@7 escape from Absalom: make speed to depart, lest he overtake us suddenly, and bring evil upon us, and smite the city with the edge of the sword.
verse	10	15	15	@@And the king's servants said unto the king, Behold, thy servants @9are ready to do@7 whatsoever my lord the king shall appoint.
