verse	10	17	10	@@And he also @9that is@7 valiant, whose heart @9is@7 as the heart of a lion, shall utterly melt: for all Israel knoweth that thy father @9is@7 a mighty man, and @9they@7 which @9be@7 with him @9are@7 valiant men.
verse	10	17	11	@@Therefore I counsel that all Israel be generally gathered unto thee, from Dan even to Beersheba, as the sand that @9is@7 by the sea for multitude; and that thou go to battle in thine own person.
