verse	10	18	12	@@And the man said unto Joab, Though I should receive a thousand @9shekels@7 of silver in mine hand, yet would I not put forth mine hand against the king's son: for in our hearing the king charged thee and Abishai and Ittai, saying, Beware that none @9touch@7 the young man Absalom.
