verse	11	14	29	@@Now the rest of the acts of Rehoboam, and all that he did, @9are@7 they not written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Judah?
verse	11	14	30	@@And there was war between Rehoboam and Jeroboam all @9their@7 days.
verse	11	14	31	@@And Rehoboam slept with his fathers, and was buried with his fathers in the city of David. And his mother's name @9was@7 Naamah an Ammonitess. And Abijam his son reigned in his stead.
verse	11	15	1	Now in the eighteenth year of king Jeroboam the son of Nebat reigned Abijam over Judah.
