verse	11	15	7	@@Now the rest of the acts of Abijam, and all that he did, @9are@7 they not written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Judah? And there was war between Abijam and Jeroboam.
verse	11	15	8	And Abijam slept with his fathers; and they buried him in the city of David: and Asa his son reigned in his stead.
verse	11	15	9	And in the twentieth year of Jeroboam king of Israel reigned Asa over Judah.
