verse	11	15	12	And he took away the sodomites out of the land, and removed all the idols that his fathers had made.
verse	11	15	13	@@And also Maachah his mother, even her he removed from @9being@7 queen, because she had made an idol in a grove; and Asa destroyed her idol, and burnt @9it@7 by the brook Kidron.
