verse	11	15	23	@@The rest of all the acts of Asa, and all his might, and all that he did, and the cities which he built, @9are@7 they not written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Judah? Nevertheless in the time of his old age he was diseased in his feet.
verse	11	15	24	And Asa slept with his fathers, and was buried with his fathers in the city of David his father: and Jehoshaphat his son reigned in his stead.
