verse	11	15	29	@@And it came to pass, when he reigned, @9that@7 he smote all the house of Jeroboam; he left not to Jeroboam any that breathed, until he had destroyed him, according unto the saying of the LORD, which he spake by his servant Ahijah the Shilonite:
verse	11	15	30	Because of the sins of Jeroboam which he sinned, and which he made Israel sin, by his provocation wherewith he provoked the LORD God of Israel to anger.
verse	11	15	31	@@Now the rest of the acts of Nadab, and all that he did, @9are@7 they not written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Israel?
verse	11	15	32	And there was war between Asa and Baasha king of Israel all their days.
