verse	11	16	10	And Zimri went in and smote him, and killed him, in the twenty and seventh year of Asa king of Judah, and reigned in his stead.
verse	11	16	11	@@And it came to pass, when he began to reign, as soon as he sat on his throne, @9that@7 he slew all the house of Baasha: he left him not one that pisseth against a wall, neither of his kinsfolks, nor of his friends.
