verse	11	18	1	@@And it came to pass @9after@7 many days, that the word of the LORD came to Elijah in the third year, saying, Go, shew thyself unto Ahab; and I will send rain upon the earth.
verse	11	18	2	@@And Elijah went to shew himself unto Ahab. And @9there was@7 a sore famine in Samaria.
