verse	11	18	5	And Ahab said unto Obadiah, Go into the land, unto all fountains of water, and unto all brooks: peradventure we may find grass to save the horses and mules alive, that we lose not all the beasts.
verse	11	18	6	So they divided the land between them to pass throughout it: Ahab went one way by himself, and Obadiah went another way by himself.
verse	11	18	7	@@And as Obadiah was in the way, behold, Elijah met him: and he knew him, and fell on his face, and said, @9Art@7 thou that my lord Elijah?
verse	11	18	8	@@And he answered him, I @9am:@7 go, tell thy lord, Behold, Elijah @9is here. @7
