verse	11	18	10	@@@9As@7 the LORD thy God liveth, there is no nation or kingdom, whither my lord hath not sent to seek thee: and when they said, @9He is@7 not @9there;@7 he took an oath of the kingdom and nation, that they found thee not.
verse	11	18	11	@@And now thou sayest, Go, tell thy lord, Behold, Elijah @9is here. @7
verse	11	18	12	@@And it shall come to pass, @9as soon as@7 I am gone from thee, that the Spirit of the LORD shall carry thee whither I know not; and so when I come and tell Ahab, and he cannot find thee, he shall slay me: but I thy servant fear the LORD from my youth.
verse	11	18	13	Was it not told my lord what I did when Jezebel slew the prophets of the LORD, how I hid an hundred men of the LORD'S prophets by fifty in a cave, and fed them with bread and water?
