verse	11	18	15	@@And Elijah said, @9As@7 the LORD of hosts liveth, before whom I stand, I will surely shew myself unto him to day.
verse	11	18	16	So Obadiah went to meet Ahab, and told him: and Ahab went to meet Elijah.
verse	11	18	17	@@And it came to pass, when Ahab saw Elijah, that Ahab said unto him, @9Art@7 thou he that troubleth Israel?
verse	11	18	18	And he answered, I have not troubled Israel; but thou, and thy father's house, in that ye have forsaken the commandments of the LORD, and thou hast followed Baalim.
verse	11	18	19	@@Now therefore send, @9and@7 gather to me all Israel unto mount Carmel, and the prophets of Baal four hundred and fifty, and the prophets of the groves four hundred, which eat at Jezebel's table.
