verse	11	18	36	@@And it came to pass at @9the time of@7 the offering of the @9evening@7 sacrifice, that Elijah the prophet came near, and said, LORD God of Abraham, Isaac, and of Israel, let it be known this day that thou art God in Israel, and @9that@7 I @9am@7 thy servant, and @9that@7 I have done all these things at thy word.
