verse	11	18	39	@@And when all the people saw @9it,@7 they fell on their faces: and they said, The LORD, he @9is@7 the God; the LORD, he @9is@7 the God.
verse	11	18	40	And Elijah said unto them, Take the prophets of Baal; let not one of them escape. And they took them: and Elijah brought them down to the brook Kishon, and slew them there.
