verse	11	19	1	And Ahab told Jezebel all that Elijah had done, and withal how he had slain all the prophets with the sword.
verse	11	19	2	@@Then Jezebel sent a messenger unto Elijah, saying, So let the gods do @9to me,@7 and more also, if I make not thy life as the life of one of them by to morrow about this time.
verse	11	19	3	@@And when he saw @9that,@7 he arose, and went for his life, and came to Beersheba, which @9belongeth@7 to Judah, and left his servant there.
verse	11	19	4	@@But he himself went a day's journey into the wilderness, and came and sat down under a juniper tree: and he requested for himself that he might die; and said, It is enough; now, O LORD, take away my life; for I @9am@7 not better than my fathers.
verse	11	19	5	@@And as he lay and slept under a juniper tree, behold, then an angel touched him, and said unto him, Arise @9and@7 eat.
