verse	11	19	10	@@And he said, I have been very jealous for the LORD God of hosts: for the children of Israel have forsaken thy covenant, thrown down thine altars, and slain thy prophets with the sword; and I, @9even@7 I only, am left; and they seek my life, to take it away.
verse	11	19	11	@@And he said, Go forth, and stand upon the mount before the LORD. And, behold, the LORD passed by, and a great and strong wind rent the mountains, and brake in pieces the rocks before the LORD; @9but@7 the LORD @9was@7 not in the wind: and after the wind an earthquake; @9but@7 the LORD @9was@7 not in the earthquake:
