verse	11	19	13	@@And it was @9so,@7 when Elijah heard @9it,@7 that he wrapped his face in his mantle, and went out, and stood in the entering in of the cave. And, behold, @9there came@7 a voice unto him, and said, What doest thou here, Elijah?
verse	11	19	14	@@And he said, I have been very jealous for the LORD God of hosts: because the children of Israel have forsaken thy covenant, thrown down thine altars, and slain thy prophets with the sword; and I, @9even@7 I only, am left; and they seek my life, to take it away.
