verse	11	20	1	@@And Benhadad the king of Syria gathered all his host together: and @9there were@7 thirty and two kings with him, and horses, and chariots: and he went up and besieged Samaria, and warred against it.
verse	11	20	2	And he sent messengers to Ahab king of Israel into the city, and said unto him, Thus saith Benhadad,
