verse	11	21	1	@@And it came to pass after these things, @9that@7 Naboth the Jezreelite had a vineyard, which @9was@7 in Jezreel, hard by the palace of Ahab king of Samaria.
verse	11	21	2	@@And Ahab spake unto Naboth, saying, Give me thy vineyard, that I may have it for a garden of herbs, because it @9is@7 near unto my house: and I will give thee for it a better vineyard than it; @9or,@7 if it seem good to thee, I will give thee the worth of it in money.
