verse	11	22	4	@@And he said unto Jehoshaphat, Wilt thou go with me to battle to Ramoth-gilead? And Jehoshaphat said to the king of Israel, I @9am@7 as thou @9art,@7 my people as thy people, my horses as thy horses.
