verse	12	8	26	@@Two and twenty years old @9was@7 Ahaziah when he began to reign; and he reigned one year in Jerusalem. And his mother's name @9was@7 Athaliah, the daughter of Omri king of Israel.
verse	12	8	27	@@And he walked in the way of the house of Ahab, and did evil in the sight of the LORD, as @9did@7 the house of Ahab: for he @9was@7 the son in law of the house of Ahab.
