verse	12	9	26	@@Surely I have seen yesterday the blood of Naboth, and the blood of his sons, saith the LORD; and I will requite thee in this plat, saith the LORD. Now therefore take @9and@7 cast him into the plat @9of ground,@7 according to the word of the LORD.
verse	12	9	27	@@But when Ahaziah the king of Judah saw @9this,@7 he fled by the way of the garden house. And Jehu followed after him, and said, Smite him also in the chariot. @9And they did so@7 at the going up to Gur, which @9is@7 by Ibleam. And he fled to Megiddo, and died there.
