verse	13	6	11	And Azariah begat Amariah, and Amariah begat Ahitub,
verse	13	6	12	And Ahitub begat Zadok, and Zadok begat Shallum,
verse	13	6	13	And Shallum begat Hilkiah, and Hilkiah begat Azariah,
verse	13	6	14	And Azariah begat Seraiah, and Seraiah begat Jehozadak,
