verse	13	6	16	The sons of Levi; Gershom, Kohath, and Merari.
verse	13	6	17	@@And these @9be@7 the names of the sons of Gershom; Libni, and Shimei.
verse	13	6	18	@@And the sons of Kohath @9were,@7 Amram, and Izhar, and Hebron, and Uzziel.
verse	13	6	19	@@The sons of Merari; Mahli, and Mushi. And these @9are@7 the families of the Levites according to their fathers.
verse	13	6	20	Of Gershom; Libni his son, Jahath his son, Zimmah his son,
