verse	13	6	31	@@And these @9are they@7 whom David set over the service of song in the house of the LORD, after that the ark had rest.
verse	13	6	32	@@And they ministered before the dwelling place of the tabernacle of the congregation with singing, until Solomon had built the house of the LORD in Jerusalem: and @9then@7 they waited on their office according to their order.
