verse	13	6	48	@@Their brethren also the Levites @9were@7 appointed unto all manner of service of the tabernacle of the house of God.
verse	13	6	49	@@But Aaron and his sons offered upon the altar of the burnt offering, and on the altar of incense, @9and were appointed@7 for all the work of the @9place@7 most holy, and to make an atonement for Israel, according to all that Moses the servant of God had commanded.
verse	13	6	50	@@And these @9are@7 the sons of Aaron; Eleazar his son, Phinehas his son, Abishua his son,
