verse	13	6	55	And they gave them Hebron in the land of Judah, and the suburbs thereof round about it.
verse	13	6	56	But the fields of the city, and the villages thereof, they gave to Caleb the son of Jephunneh.
verse	13	6	57	@@And to the sons of Aaron they gave the cities of Judah, @9namely,@7 Hebron, @9the city@7 of refuge, and Libnah with her suburbs, and Jattir, and Eshtemoa, with their suburbs,
