verse	13	6	59	And Ashan with her suburbs, and Bethshemesh with her suburbs:
verse	13	6	60	@@And out of the tribe of Benjamin; Geba with her suburbs, and Alemeth with her suburbs, and Anathoth with her suburbs. All their cities throughout their families @9were@7 thirteen cities.
verse	13	6	61	@@And unto the sons of Kohath, @9which were@7 left of the family of that tribe, @9were cities given@7 out of the half tribe, @9namely, out of@7 the half @9tribe@7 of Manasseh, by lot, ten cities.
verse	13	6	62	And to the sons of Gershom throughout their families out of the tribe of Issachar, and out of the tribe of Asher, and out of the tribe of Naphtali, and out of the tribe of Manasseh in Bashan, thirteen cities.
verse	13	6	63	@@Unto the sons of Merari @9were given@7 by lot, throughout their families, out of the tribe of Reuben, and out of the tribe of Gad, and out of the tribe of Zebulun, twelve cities.
verse	13	6	64	@@And the children of Israel gave to the Levites @9these@7 cities with their suburbs.
verse	13	6	65	@@And they gave by lot out of the tribe of the children of Judah, and out of the tribe of the children of Simeon, and out of the tribe of the children of Benjamin, these cities, which are called by @9their@7 names.
verse	13	6	66	@@And @9the residue@7 of the families of the sons of Kohath had cities of their coasts out of the tribe of Ephraim.
verse	13	6	67	@@And they gave unto them, @9of@7 the cities of refuge, Shechem in mount Ephraim with her suburbs; @9they gave@7 also Gezer with her suburbs,
verse	13	6	68	And Jokmeam with her suburbs, and Bethhoron with her suburbs,
verse	13	6	69	And Aijalon with her suburbs, and Gath-rimmon with her suburbs:
verse	13	6	70	And out of the half tribe of Manasseh; Aner with her suburbs, and Bileam with her suburbs, for the family of the remnant of the sons of Kohath.
verse	13	6	71	@@Unto the sons of Gershom @9were given@7 out of the family of the half tribe of Manasseh, Golan in Bashan with her suburbs, and Ashtaroth with her suburbs:
