verse	13	6	73	And Ramoth with her suburbs, and Anem with her suburbs:
verse	13	6	74	And out of the tribe of Asher; Mashal with her suburbs, and Abdon with her suburbs,
verse	13	6	75	And Hukok with her suburbs, and Rehob with her suburbs:
verse	13	6	76	And out of the tribe of Naphtali; Kedesh in Galilee with her suburbs, and Hammon with her suburbs, and Kirjathaim with her suburbs.
verse	13	6	77	@@Unto the rest of the children of Merari @9were given@7 out of the tribe of Zebulun. Rimmon with her suburbs, Tabor with her suburbs:
verse	13	6	78	@@And on the other side Jordan by Jericho, on the east side of Jordan, @9were given them@7 out of the tribe of Reuben, Bezer in the wilderness with her suburbs, and Jahzah with her suburbs,
