verse	13	7	1	@@Now the sons of Issachar @9were,@7 Tola, and Puah, Jashub, and Shimrom, four.
verse	13	7	2	@@And the sons of Tola; Uzzi, and Rephaiah, and Jeriel, and Jahmai, and Jibsam, and Shemuel, heads of their father's house, @9to wit,@7 of Tola: @9they were@7 valiant men of might in their generations; whose number @9was@7 in the days of David two and twenty thousand and six hundred.
verse	13	7	3	And the sons of Uzzi; Izrahiah: and the sons of Izrahiah; Michael, and Obadiah, and Joel, Ishiah, five: all of them chief men.
verse	13	7	4	@@And with them, by their generations, after the house of their fathers, @9were@7 bands of soldiers for war, six and thirty thousand @9men:@7 for they had many wives and sons.
verse	13	7	5	@@And their brethren among all the families of Issachar @9were@7 valiant men of might, reckoned in all by their genealogies fourscore and seven thousand.
verse	13	7	6	@@@9The sons@7 of Benjamin; Bela, and Becher, and Jediael, three.
verse	13	7	7	@@And the sons of Bela; Ezbon, and Uzzi, and Uzziel, and Jerimoth, and Iri, five; heads of the house of @9their@7 fathers, mighty men of valour; and were reckoned by their genealogies twenty and two thousand and thirty and four.
verse	13	7	8	@@And the sons of Becher; Zemira, and Joash, and Eliezer, and Elioenai, and Omri, and Jerimoth, and Abiah, and Anathoth, and Alameth. All these @9are@7 the sons of Becher.
verse	13	7	9	@@And the number of them, after their genealogy by their generations, heads of the house of the fathers, mighty men of valour, @9was@7 twenty thousand and two hundred.
verse	13	7	10	The sons also of Jediael; Bilhan: and the sons of Bilhan; Jeush, and Benjamin, and Ehud, and Chenaanah, and Zethan, and Tharshish, and Ahishahar.
verse	13	7	11	@@All these the sons of Jediael, by the heads of their fathers, mighty men of valour, @9were@7 seventeen thousand and two hundred @9soldiers,@7 fit to go out for war @9and@7 battle.
verse	13	7	12	@@Shuppim also, and Huppim, the children of Ir, @9and@7 Hushim, the sons of Aher.
verse	13	7	13	The sons of Naphtali; Jahziel, and Guni, and Jezer, and Shallum, the sons of Bilhah.
verse	13	7	14	@@The sons of Manasseh; Ashriel, whom she bare: @9(but@7 his concubine the Aramitess bare Machir the father of Gilead:
verse	13	7	15	@@And Machir took to wife @9the sister@7 of Huppim and Shuppim, whose sister's name @9was@7 Maachah;) and the name of the second @9was@7 Zelophehad: and Zelophehad had daughters.
verse	13	7	16	@@And Maachah the wife of Machir bare a son, and she called his name Peresh; and the name of his brother @9was@7 Sheresh; and his sons @9were@7 Ulam and Rakem.
verse	13	7	17	@@And the sons of Ulam; Bedan. These @9were@7 the sons of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Manasseh.
verse	13	7	18	And his sister Hammoleketh bare Ishod, and Abiezer, and Mahalah.
verse	13	7	19	And the sons of Shemidah were, Ahian, and Shechem, and Likhi, and Aniam.
verse	13	7	20	And the sons of Ephraim; Shuthelah, and Bered his son, and Tahath his son, and Eladah his son, and Tahath his son,
verse	13	7	21	@@And Zabad his son, and Shuthelah his son, and Ezer, and Elead, whom the men of Gath @9that were@7 born in @9that@7 land slew, because they came down to take away their cattle.
verse	13	7	22	And Ephraim their father mourned many days, and his brethren came to comfort him.
verse	13	7	23	And when he went in to his wife, she conceived, and bare a son, and he called his name Beriah, because it went evil with his house.
verse	13	7	24	@@(And his daughter @9was@7 Sherah, who built Bethhoron the nether, and the upper, and Uzzen-sherah.)
verse	13	7	25	@@And Rephah @9was@7 his son, also Resheph, and Telah his son, and Tahan his son,
verse	13	7	26	Laadan his son, Ammihud his son, Elishama his son,
verse	13	7	27	Non his son, Jehoshuah his son.
verse	13	7	28	@@And their possessions and habitations @9were,@7 Bethel and the towns thereof, and eastward Naaran, and westward Gezer, with the towns thereof; Shechem also and the towns thereof, unto Gaza and the towns thereof:
verse	13	7	29	And by the borders of the children of Manasseh, Bethshean and her towns, Taanach and her towns, Megiddo and her towns, Dor and her towns. In these dwelt the children of Joseph the son of Israel.
verse	13	7	30	The sons of Asher; Imnah, and Isuah, and Ishuai, and Beriah, and Serah their sister.
verse	13	7	31	@@And the sons of Beriah; Heber, and Malchiel, who @9is@7 the father of Birzavith.
verse	13	7	32	And Heber begat Japhlet, and Shomer, and Hotham, and Shua their sister.
verse	13	7	33	@@And the sons of Japhlet; Pasach, and Bimhal, and Ashvath. These @9are@7 the children of Japhlet.
verse	13	7	34	And the sons of Shamer; Ahi, and Rohgah, Jehubbah, and Aram.
verse	13	7	35	And the sons of his brother Helem; Zophah, and Imna, and Shelesh, and Amal.
verse	13	7	36	The sons of Zophah; Suah, and Harnepher, and Shual, and Beri, and Imrah,
verse	13	7	37	Bezer, and Hod, and Shamma and Shilshah, and Ithran, and Beera.
verse	13	7	38	And the sons of Jether; Jephunneh, and Pispah, and Ara.
verse	13	7	39	And the sons of Ulla; Arah, and Haniel, and Rezia.
verse	13	7	40	@@All these @9were@7 the children of Asher, heads of @9their@7 father's house, choice @9and@7 mighty men of valour, chief of the princes. And the number throughout the genealogy of them that were apt to the war @9and@7 to battle @9was@7 twenty and six thousand men.
verse	13	8	1	Now Benjamin begat Bela his firstborn, Ashbel the second, and Aharah the third,
verse	13	8	2	Nohah the fourth, and Rapha the fifth.
verse	13	8	3	And the sons of Bela were, Addar, and Gera, and Abihud,
verse	13	8	4	And Abishua, and Naaman, and Ahoah,
verse	13	8	5	And Gera, and Shephuphan, and Huram.
verse	13	8	6	@@And these @9are@7 the sons of Ehud: these are the heads of the fathers of the inhabitants of Geba, and they removed them to Manahath:
verse	13	8	7	And Naaman, and Ahiah, and Gera, he removed them, and begat Uzza, and Ahihud.
verse	13	8	8	@@And Shaharaim begat @9children@7 in the country of Moab, after he had sent them away; Hushim and Baara @9were@7 his wives.
verse	13	8	9	And he begat of Hodesh his wife, Jobab, and Zibia, and Mesha, and Malcham,
verse	13	8	10	@@And Jeuz, and Shachia, and Mirma. These @9were@7 his sons, heads of the fathers.
verse	13	8	11	And of Hushim he begat Abitub, and Elpaal.
verse	13	8	12	The sons of Elpaal; Eber, and Misham, and Shamed, who built Ono, and Lod, with the towns thereof:
verse	13	8	13	@@Beriah also, and Shema, who @9were@7 heads of the fathers of the inhabitants of Aijalon, who drove away the inhabitants of Gath:
verse	13	8	14	And Ahio, Shashak, and Jeremoth,
verse	13	8	15	And Zebadiah, and Arad, and Ader,
verse	13	8	16	And Michael, and Ispah, and Joha, the sons of Beriah;
verse	13	8	17	And Zebadiah, and Meshullam, and Hezeki, and Heber,
verse	13	8	18	Ishmerai also, and Jezliah, and Jobab, the sons of Elpaal;
verse	13	8	19	And Jakim, and Zichri, and Zabdi,
verse	13	8	20	And Elienai, and Zilthai, and Eliel,
verse	13	8	21	And Adaiah, and Beraiah, and Shimrath, the sons of Shimhi;
verse	13	8	22	And Ishpan, and Heber, and Eliel,
verse	13	8	23	And Abdon, and Zichri, and Hanan,
verse	13	8	24	And Hananiah, and Elam, and Antothijah,
verse	13	8	25	And Iphedeiah, and Penuel, the sons of Shashak;
verse	13	8	26	And Shamsherai, and Shehariah, and Athaliah,
verse	13	8	27	And Jaresiah, and Eliah, and Zichri, the sons of Jeroham.
verse	13	8	28	@@These @9were@7 heads of the fathers, by their generations, chief @9men.@7 These dwelt in Jerusalem.
verse	13	8	29	@@And at Gibeon dwelt the father of Gibeon; whose wife's name @9was@7 Maachah:
verse	13	8	30	And his firstborn son Abdon, and Zur, and Kish, and Baal, and Nadab,
verse	13	8	31	And Gedor, and Ahio, and Zacher.
verse	13	8	32	And Mikloth begat Shimeah. And these also dwelt with their brethren in Jerusalem, over against them.
verse	13	8	33	And Ner begat Kish, and Kish begat Saul, and Saul begat Jonathan, and Malchi-shua, and Abinadab, and Esh-baal.
verse	13	8	34	@@And the son of Jonathan @9was@7 Merib-baal; and Merib-baal begat Micah.
verse	13	8	35	@@And the sons of Micah @9were,@7 Pithon, and Melech, and Tarea, and Ahaz.
verse	13	8	36	And Ahaz begat Jehoadah; and Jehoadah begat Alemeth, and Azmaveth, and Zimri; and Zimri begat Moza,
verse	13	8	37	@@And Moza begat Binea: Rapha @9was@7 his son, Eleasah his son, Azel his son:
verse	13	8	38	@@And Azel had six sons, whose names @9are@7 these, Azrikam, Bocheru, and Ishmael, and Sheariah, and Obadiah, and Hanan. All these @9were@7 the sons of Azel.
