verse	13	11	23	@@And he slew an Egyptian, a man of @9great@7 stature, five cubits high; and in the Egyptian's hand @9was@7 a spear like a weaver's beam; and he went down to him with a staff, and plucked the spear out of the Egyptian's hand, and slew him with his own spear.
