verse	13	13	1	@@And David consulted with the captains of thousands and hundreds, @9and@7 with every leader.
verse	13	13	2	@@And David said unto all the congregation of Israel, If @9it seem@7 good unto you, and @9that it be@7 of the LORD our God, let us send abroad unto our brethren every where, @9that are@7 left in all the land of Israel, and with them @9also@7 to the priests and Levites @9which are@7 in their cities @9and@7 suburbs, that they may gather themselves unto us:
