verse	13	13	5	So David gathered all Israel together, from Shihor of Egypt even unto the entering of Hemath, to bring the ark of God from Kirjathjearim.
verse	13	13	6	@@And David went up, and all Israel, to Baalah, @9that is,@7 to Kirjath-jearim, which @9belonged@7 to Judah, to bring up thence the ark of God the LORD, that dwelleth @9between@7 the cherubims, whose name is called @9on it. @7
