verse	13	14	15	@@And it shall be, when thou shalt hear a sound of going in the tops of the mulberry trees, @9that@7 then thou shalt go out to battle: for God is gone forth before thee to smite the host of the Philistines.
verse	13	14	16	David therefore did as God commanded him: and they smote the host of the Philistines from Gibeon even to Gazer.
verse	13	14	17	And the fame of David went out into all lands; and the LORD brought the fear of him upon all nations.
verse	13	15	1	@@And @9David@7 made him houses in the city of David, and prepared a place for the ark of God, and pitched for it a tent.
verse	13	15	2	Then David said, None ought to carry the ark of God but the Levites: for them hath the LORD chosen to carry the ark of God, and to minister unto him for ever.
verse	13	15	3	And David gathered all Israel together to Jerusalem, to bring up the ark of the LORD unto his place, which he had prepared for it.
verse	13	15	4	And David assembled the children of Aaron, and the Levites:
verse	13	15	5	Of the sons of Kohath; Uriel the chief, and his brethren an hundred and twenty:
verse	13	15	6	Of the sons of Merari; Asaiah the chief, and his brethren two hundred and twenty:
verse	13	15	7	Of the sons of Gershom; Joel the chief, and his brethren an hundred and thirty:
