verse	13	15	23	@@And Berechiah and Elkanah @9were@7 doorkeepers for the ark.
verse	13	15	24	@@And Shebaniah, and Jehoshaphat, and Nethaneel, and Amasai, and Zechariah, and Benaiah, and Eliezer, the priests, did blow with the trumpets before the ark of God: and Obededom and Jehiah @9were@7 doorkeepers for the ark.
verse	13	15	25	So David, and the elders of Israel, and the captains over thousands, went to bring up the ark of the covenant of the LORD out of the house of Obededom with joy.
