verse	13	16	22	@@@9Saying,@7 Touch not mine anointed, and do my prophets no harm.
verse	13	16	23	Sing unto the LORD, all the earth; shew forth from day to day his salvation.
verse	13	16	24	Declare his glory among the heathen; his marvellous works among all nations.
verse	13	16	25	@@For great @9is@7 the LORD, and greatly to be praised: he also @9is@7 to be feared above all gods.
verse	13	16	26	@@For all the gods of the people @9are@7 idols: but the LORD made the heavens.
verse	13	16	27	@@Glory and honour @9are@7 in his presence; strength and gladness @9are@7 in his place.
verse	13	16	28	Give unto the LORD, ye kindreds of the people, give unto the LORD glory and strength.
verse	13	16	29	@@Give unto the LORD the glory @9due@7 unto his name: bring an offering, and come before him: worship the LORD in the beauty of holiness.
verse	13	16	30	Fear before him, all the earth: the world also shall be stable, that it be not moved.
verse	13	16	31	@@Let the heavens be glad, and let the earth rejoice: and let @9men@7 say among the nations, The LORD reigneth.
verse	13	16	32	@@Let the sea roar, and the fulness thereof: let the fields rejoice, and all that @9is@7 therein.
verse	13	16	33	Then shall the trees of the wood sing out at the presence of the LORD, because he cometh to judge the earth.
