verse	13	16	37	So he left there before the ark of the covenant of the LORD Asaph and his brethren, to minister before the ark continually, as every day's work required:
verse	13	16	38	@@And Obed-edom with their brethren, threescore and eight; Obededom also the son of Jeduthun and Hosah @9to be@7 porters:
verse	13	16	39	@@And Zadok the priest, and his brethren the priests, before the tabernacle of the LORD in the high place that @9was@7 at Gibeon,
verse	13	16	40	@@To offer burnt offerings unto the LORD upon the altar of the burnt offering continually morning and evening, and @9to do@7 according to all that is written in the law of the LORD, which he commanded Israel;
