verse	13	21	1	And Satan stood up against Israel, and provoked David to number Israel.
verse	13	21	2	@@And David said to Joab and to the rulers of the people, Go, number Israel from Beersheba even to Dan; and bring the number of them to me, that I may know @9it. @7
verse	13	21	3	@@And Joab answered, The LORD make his people an hundred times so many more as they @9be:@7 but, my lord the king, @9are@7 they not all my lord's servants? why then doth my lord require this thing? why will he be a cause of trespass to Israel?
verse	13	21	4	Nevertheless the king's word prevailed against Joab. Wherefore Joab departed, and went throughout all Israel, and came to Jerusalem.
verse	13	21	5	@@And Joab gave the sum of the number of the people unto David. And all @9they of@7 Israel were a thousand thousand and an hundred thousand men that drew sword: and Judah @9was@7 four hundred threescore and ten thousand men that drew sword.
