verse	13	24	29	@@Concerning Kish: the son of Kish @9was@7 Jerahmeel.
verse	13	24	30	@@The sons also of Mushi; Mahli, and Eder, and Jerimoth. These @9were@7 the sons of the Levites after the house of their fathers.
verse	13	24	31	These likewise cast lots over against their brethren the sons of Aaron in the presence of David the king, and Zadok, and Ahimelech, and the chief of the fathers of the priests and Levites, even the principal fathers over against their younger brethren.
verse	13	25	1	Moreover David and the captains of the host separated to the service of the sons of Asaph, and of Heman, and of Jeduthun, who should prophesy with harps, with psalteries, and with cymbals: and the number of the workmen according to their service was:
verse	13	25	2	Of the sons of Asaph; Zaccur, and Joseph, and Nethaniah, and Asarelah, the sons of Asaph under the hands of Asaph, which prophesied according to the order of the king.
verse	13	25	3	Of Jeduthun: the sons of Jeduthun; Gedaliah, and Zeri, and Jeshaiah, Hashabiah, and Mattithiah, six, under the hands of their father Jeduthun, who prophesied with a harp, to give thanks and to praise the LORD.
verse	13	25	4	@@Of Heman: the sons of Heman; Bukkiah, Mattaniah, Uzziel, Shebuel, and Jerimoth, Hananiah, Hanani, Eliathah, Giddalti, and Romamti-ezer, Joshbekashah, Mallothi, Hothir, @9and@7 Mahazioth:
verse	13	25	5	@@All these @9were@7 the sons of Heman the king's seer in the words of God, to lift up the horn. And God gave to Heman fourteen sons and three daughters.
verse	13	25	6	@@All these @9were@7 under the hands of their father for song @9in@7 the house of the LORD, with cymbals, psalteries, and harps, for the service of the house of God, according to the king's order to Asaph, Jeduthun, and Heman.
verse	13	25	7	@@So the number of them, with their brethren that were instructed in the songs of the LORD, @9even@7 all that were cunning, was two hundred fourscore and eight.
verse	13	25	8	@@And they cast lots, ward against @9ward,@7 as well the small as the great, the teacher as the scholar.
verse	13	25	9	@@Now the first lot came forth for Asaph to Joseph: the second to Gedaliah, who with his brethren and sons @9were@7 twelve:
