verse	13	25	11	@@The fourth to Izri, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
verse	13	25	12	@@The fifth to Nethaniah, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
verse	13	25	13	@@The sixth to Bukkiah, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
