verse	13	25	15	@@The eighth to Jeshaiah, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
verse	13	25	16	@@The ninth to Mattaniah, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
verse	13	25	17	@@The tenth to Shimei, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
