verse	13	25	24	@@The seventeenth to Joshbekashah, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
verse	13	25	25	@@The eighteenth to Hanani, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
verse	13	25	26	@@The nineteenth to Mallothi, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve:
