verse	13	25	31	@@The four and twentieth to Romamti-ezer, @9he,@7 his sons, and his brethren, @9were@7 twelve.
verse	13	26	1	@@Concerning the divisions of the porters: Of the Korhites @9was@7 Meshelemiah the son of Kore, of the sons of Asaph.
verse	13	26	2	@@And the sons of Meshelemiah @9were,@7 Zechariah the firstborn, Jediael the second, Zebadiah the third, Jathniel the fourth,
verse	13	26	3	Elam the fifth, Jehohanan the sixth, Elioenai the seventh.
verse	13	26	4	@@Moreover the sons of Obededom @9were,@7 Shemaiah the firstborn, Jehozabad the second, Joah the third, and Sacar the fourth, and Nethaneel the fifth,
verse	13	26	5	Ammiel the sixth, Issachar the seventh, Peulthai the eighth: for God blessed him.
verse	13	26	6	@@Also unto Shemaiah his son were sons born, that ruled throughout the house of their father: for they @9were@7 mighty men of valour.
verse	13	26	7	@@The sons of Shemaiah; Othni, and Rephael, and Obed, Elzabad, whose brethren @9were@7 strong men, Elihu, and Semachiah.
verse	13	26	8	@@All these of the sons of Obededom: they and their sons and their brethren, able men for strength for the service, @9were@7 threescore and two of Obededom.
verse	13	26	9	And Meshelemiah had sons and brethren, strong men, eighteen.
verse	13	26	10	@@Also Hosah, of the children of Merari, had sons; Simri the chief, (for @9though@7 he was not the firstborn, yet his father made him the chief;)
verse	13	26	11	@@Hilkiah the second, Tebaliah the third, Zechariah the fourth: all the sons and brethren of Hosah @9were@7 thirteen.
verse	13	26	12	@@Among these @9were@7 the divisions of the porters, @9even@7 among the chief men, @9having@7 wards one against another, to minister in the house of the LORD.
verse	13	26	13	And they cast lots, as well the small as the great, according to the house of their fathers, for every gate.
verse	13	26	14	And the lot eastward fell to Shelemiah. Then for Zechariah his son, a wise counsellor, they cast lots; and his lot came out northward.
verse	13	26	15	To Obed-edom southward; and to his sons the house of Asuppim.
verse	13	26	16	@@To Shuppim and Hosah @9the lot came forth@7 westward, with the gate Shallecheth, by the causeway of the going up, ward against ward.
verse	13	26	17	@@Eastward @9were@7 six Levites, northward four a day, southward four a day, and toward Asuppim two @9and@7 two.
verse	13	26	18	@@At Parbar westward, four at the causeway, @9and@7 two at Parbar.
