verse	13	27	23	But David took not the number of them from twenty years old and under: because the LORD had said he would increase Israel like to the stars of the heavens.
verse	13	27	24	Joab the son of Zeruiah began to number, but he finished not, because there fell wrath for it against Israel; neither was the number put in the account of the chronicles of king David.
verse	13	27	25	@@And over the king's treasures @9was@7 Azmaveth the son of Adiel: and over the storehouses in the fields, in the cities, and in the villages, and in the castles, @9was@7 Jehonathan the son of Uzziah:
