verse	13	28	20	@@And David said to Solomon his son, Be strong and of good courage, and do @9it:@7 fear not, nor be dismayed: for the LORD God, @9even@7 my God, @9will be@7 with thee; he will not fail thee, nor forsake thee, until thou hast finished all the work for the service of the house of the LORD.
verse	13	28	21	@@And, behold, the courses of the priests and the Levites, @9even they shall be with thee@7 for all the service of the house of God: and @9there shall be@7 with thee for all manner of workmanship every willing skilful man, for any manner of service: also the princes and all the people @9will be@7 wholly at thy commandment.
verse	13	29	1	@@Furthermore David the king said unto all the congregation, Solomon my son, whom alone God hath chosen, @9is yet@7 young and tender, and the work @9is@7 great: for the palace @9is@7 not for man, but for the LORD God.
verse	13	29	2	@@Now I have prepared with all my might for the house of my God the gold for @9things to be made@7 of gold, and the silver for @9things@7 of silver, and the brass for @9things@7 of brass, the iron for @9things@7 of iron, and wood for @9things@7 of wood; onyx stones, and @9stones@7 to be set, glistering stones, and of divers colours, and all manner of precious stones, and marble stones in abundance.
verse	13	29	3	@@Moreover, because I have set my affection to the house of my God, I have of mine own proper good, of gold and silver, @9which@7 I have given to the house of my God, over and above all that I have prepared for the holy house,
