verse	13	29	10	@@Wherefore David blessed the LORD before all the congregation: and David said, Blessed @9be@7 thou, LORD God of Israel our father, for ever and ever.
verse	13	29	11	@@Thine, O LORD, @9is@7 the greatness, and the power, and the glory, and the victory, and the majesty: for all @9that is@7 in the heaven and in the earth @9is thine;@7 thine @9is@7 the kingdom, O LORD, and thou art exalted as head above all.
verse	13	29	12	@@Both riches and honour @9come@7 of thee, and thou reignest over all; and in thine hand @9is@7 power and might; and in thine hand @9it is@7 to make great, and to give strength unto all.
verse	13	29	13	Now therefore, our God, we thank thee, and praise thy glorious name.
verse	13	29	14	@@But who @9am@7 I, and what @9is@7 my people, that we should be able to offer so willingly after this sort? for all things @9come@7 of thee, and of thine own have we given thee.
