verse	14	23	6	@@But let none come into the house of the LORD, save the priests, and they that minister of the Levites; they shall go in, for they @9are@7 holy: but all the people shall keep the watch of the LORD.
verse	14	23	7	@@And the Levites shall compass the king round about, every man with his weapons in his hand; and whosoever @9else@7 cometh into the house, he shall be put to death: but be ye with the king when he cometh in, and when he goeth out.
verse	14	23	8	@@So the Levites and all Judah did according to all things that Jehoiada the priest had commanded, and took every man his men that were to come in on the sabbath, with them that were to go @9out@7 on the sabbath: for Jehoiada the priest dismissed not the courses.
verse	14	23	9	@@Moreover Jehoiada the priest delivered to the captains of hundreds spears, and bucklers, and shields, that @9had been@7 king David's, which @9were@7 in the house of God.
