verse	14	24	5	And he gathered together the priests and the Levites, and said to them, Go out unto the cities of Judah, and gather of all Israel money to repair the house of your God from year to year, and see that ye hasten the matter. Howbeit the Levites hastened it not.
verse	14	24	6	@@And the king called for Jehoiada the chief, and said unto him, Why hast thou not required of the Levites to bring in out of Judah and out of Jerusalem the collection, @9according to the commandment@7 of Moses the servant of the LORD, and of the congregation of Israel, for the tabernacle of witness?
