verse	14	24	27	@@Now @9concerning@7 his sons, and the greatness of the burdens @9laid@7 upon him, and the repairing of the house of God, behold, they @9are@7 written in the story of the book of the kings. And Amaziah his son reigned in his stead.
verse	14	25	1	@@Amaziah @9was@7 twenty and five years old @9when@7 he began to reign, and he reigned twenty and nine years in Jerusalem. And his mother's name @9was@7 Jehoaddan of Jerusalem.
verse	14	25	2	@@And he did @9that which was@7 right in the sight of the LORD, but not with a perfect heart.
