verse	14	25	5	@@Moreover Amaziah gathered Judah together, and made them captains over thousands, and captains over hundreds, according to the houses of @9their@7 fathers, throughout all Judah and Benjamin: and he numbered them from twenty years old and above, and found them three hundred thousand choice @9men, able@7 to go forth to war, that could handle spear and shield.
verse	14	25	6	He hired also an hundred thousand mighty men of valour out of Israel for an hundred talents of silver.
verse	14	25	7	@@But there came a man of God to him, saying, O king, let not the army of Israel go with thee; for the LORD @9is@7 not with Israel, @9to wit, with@7 all the children of Ephraim.
