verse	14	28	13	@@And said unto them, Ye shall not bring in the captives hither: for whereas we have offended against the LORD @9already,@7 ye intend to add @9more@7 to our sins and to our trespass: for our trespass is great, and @9there is@7 fierce wrath against Israel.
verse	14	28	14	So the armed men left the captives and the spoil before the princes and all the congregation.
verse	14	28	15	And the men which were expressed by name rose up, and took the captives, and with the spoil clothed all that were naked among them, and arrayed them, and shod them, and gave them to eat and to drink, and anointed them, and carried all the feeble of them upon asses, and brought them to Jericho, the city of palm trees, to their brethren: then they returned to Samaria.
