verse	14	28	27	@@And Ahaz slept with his fathers, and they buried him in the city, @9even@7 in Jerusalem: but they brought him not into the sepulchres of the kings of Israel: and Hezekiah his son reigned in his stead.
verse	14	29	1	@@Hezekiah began to reign @9when he was@7 five and twenty years old, and he reigned nine and twenty years in Jerusalem. And his mother's name @9was@7 Abijah, the daughter of Zechariah.
