verse	14	29	5	@@And said unto them, Hear me, ye Levites, sanctify now yourselves, and sanctify the house of the LORD God of your fathers, and carry forth the filthiness out of the holy @9place. @7
verse	14	29	6	@@For our fathers have trespassed, and done @9that which was@7 evil in the eyes of the LORD our God, and have forsaken him, and have turned away their faces from the habitation of the LORD, and turned @9their@7 backs.
verse	14	29	7	@@Also they have shut up the doors of the porch, and put out the lamps, and have not burned incense nor offered burnt offerings in the holy @9place@7 unto the God of Israel.
