verse	14	33	18	@@Now the rest of the acts of Manasseh, and his prayer unto his God, and the words of the seers that spake to him in the name of the LORD God of Israel, behold, they @9are written@7 in the book of the kings of Israel.
verse	14	33	19	@@His prayer also, and @9how God@7 was intreated of him, and all his sin, and his trespass, and the places wherein he built high places, and set up groves and graven images, before he was humbled: behold, they @9are@7 written among the sayings of the seers.
verse	14	33	20	So Manasseh slept with his fathers, and they buried him in his own house: and Amon his son reigned in his stead.
