verse	14	34	13	@@Also @9they were@7 over the bearers of burdens, and @9were@7 overseers of all that wrought the work in any manner of service: and of the Levites @9there were@7 scribes, and officers, and porters.
verse	14	34	14	@@And when they brought out the money that was brought into the house of the LORD, Hilkiah the priest found a book of the law of the LORD @9given@7 by Moses.
