verse	14	34	21	@@Go, enquire of the LORD for me, and for them that are left in Israel and in Judah, concerning the words of the book that is found: for great @9is@7 the wrath of the LORD that is poured out upon us, because our fathers have not kept the word of the LORD, to do after all that is written in this book.
verse	14	34	22	@@And Hilkiah, and @9they@7 that the king @9had appointed,@7 went to Huldah the prophetess, the wife of Shallum the son of Tikvath, the son of Hasrah, keeper of the wardrobe; (now she dwelt in Jerusalem in the college:) and they spake to her to that @9effect.@7
verse	14	34	23	And she answered them, Thus saith the LORD God of Israel, Tell ye the man that sent you to me,
