verse	14	35	20	After all this, when Josiah had prepared the temple, Necho king of Egypt came up to fight against Charchemish by Euphrates: and Josiah went out against him.
verse	14	35	21	@@But he sent ambassadors to him, saying, What have I to do with thee, thou king of Judah? @9I come@7 not against thee this day, but against the house wherewith I have war: for God commanded me to make haste: forbear thee from @9meddling with@7 God, who @9is@7 with me, that he destroy thee not.
