verse	15	2	4	The children of Shephatiah, three hundred seventy and two.
verse	15	2	5	The children of Arah, seven hundred seventy and five.
verse	15	2	6	@@The children of Pahath-moab, of the children of Jeshua @9and@7 Joab, two thousand eight hundred and twelve.
verse	15	2	7	The children of Elam, a thousand two hundred fifty and four.
verse	15	2	8	The children of Zattu, nine hundred forty and five.
verse	15	2	9	The children of Zaccai, seven hundred and threescore.
verse	15	2	10	The children of Bani, six hundred forty and two.
