verse	15	2	12	The children of Azgad, a thousand two hundred twenty and two.
verse	15	2	13	The children of Adonikam, six hundred sixty and six.
verse	15	2	14	The children of Bigvai, two thousand fifty and six.
verse	15	2	15	The children of Adin, four hundred fifty and four.
verse	15	2	16	The children of Ater of Hezekiah, ninety and eight.
verse	15	2	17	The children of Bezai, three hundred twenty and three.
verse	15	2	18	The children of Jorah, an hundred and twelve.
verse	15	2	19	The children of Hashum, two hundred twenty and three.
verse	15	2	20	The children of Gibbar, ninety and five.
verse	15	2	21	The children of Bethlehem, an hundred twenty and three.
verse	15	2	22	The men of Netophah, fifty and six.
verse	15	2	23	The men of Anathoth, an hundred twenty and eight.
verse	15	2	24	The children of Azmaveth, forty and two.
verse	15	2	25	The children of Kirjath-arim, Chephirah, and Beeroth, seven hundred and forty and three.
verse	15	2	26	The children of Ramah and Gaba, six hundred twenty and one.
verse	15	2	27	The men of Michmas, an hundred twenty and two.
verse	15	2	28	The men of Bethel and Ai, two hundred twenty and three.
verse	15	2	29	The children of Nebo, fifty and two.
verse	15	2	30	The children of Magbish, an hundred fifty and six.
verse	15	2	31	The children of the other Elam, a thousand two hundred fifty and four.
verse	15	2	32	The children of Harim, three hundred and twenty.
verse	15	2	33	The children of Lod, Hadid, and Ono, seven hundred twenty and five.
verse	15	2	34	The children of Jericho, three hundred forty and five.
verse	15	2	35	The children of Senaah, three thousand and six hundred and thirty.
verse	15	2	36	The priests: the children of Jedaiah, of the house of Jeshua, nine hundred seventy and three.
verse	15	2	37	The children of Immer, a thousand fifty and two.
verse	15	2	38	The children of Pashur, a thousand two hundred forty and seven.
verse	15	2	39	The children of Harim, a thousand and seventeen.
verse	15	2	40	The Levites: the children of Jeshua and Kadmiel, of the children of Hodaviah, seventy and four.
verse	15	2	41	The singers: the children of Asaph, an hundred twenty and eight.
verse	15	2	42	@@The children of the porters: the children of Shallum, the children of Ater, the children of Talmon, the children of Akkub, the children of Hatita, the children of Shobai, @9in@7 all an hundred thirty and nine.
verse	15	2	43	The Nethinims: the children of Ziha, the children of Hasupha, the children of Tabbaoth,
verse	15	2	44	The children of Keros, the children of Siaha, the children of Padon,
