verse	16	10	5	Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah,
verse	16	10	6	Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruch,
verse	16	10	7	Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin,
verse	16	10	8	@@Maaziah, Bilgai, Shemaiah: these @9were@7 the priests.
verse	16	10	9	And the Levites: both Jeshua the son of Azaniah, Binnui of the sons of Henadad, Kadmiel;
verse	16	10	10	And their brethren, Shebaniah, Hodijah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan,
verse	16	10	11	Micha, Rehob, Hashabiah,
verse	16	10	12	Zaccur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah,
