verse	17	4	8	@@Also he gave him the copy of the writing of the decree that was given at Shushan to destroy them, to shew @9it@7 unto Esther, and to declare @9it@7 unto her, and to charge her that she should go in unto the king, to make supplication unto him, and to make request before him for her people.
