verse	17	5	1	@@Now it came to pass on the third day, that Esther put on @9her@7 royal @9apparel,@7 and stood in the inner court of the king's house, over against the king's house: and the king sat upon his royal throne in the royal house, over against the gate of the house.
verse	17	5	2	@@And it was so, when the king saw Esther the queen standing in the court, @9that@7 she obtained favour in his sight: and the king held out to Esther the golden sceptre that @9was@7 in his hand. So Esther drew near, and touched the top of the sceptre.
verse	17	5	3	@@Then said the king unto her, What wilt thou, queen Esther? and what @9is@7 thy request? it shall be even given thee to the half of the kingdom.
