verse	17	6	9	@@And let this apparel and horse be delivered to the hand of one of the king's most noble princes, that they may array the man @9withal@7 whom the king delighteth to honour, and bring him on horseback through the street of the city, and proclaim before him, Thus shall it be done to the man whom the king delighteth to honour.
verse	17	6	10	@@Then the king said to Haman, Make haste, @9and@7 take the apparel and the horse, as thou hast said, and do even so to Mordecai the Jew, that sitteth at the king's gate: let nothing fail of all that thou hast spoken.
