verse	17	7	1	So the king and Haman came to banquet with Esther the queen.
verse	17	7	2	@@And the king said again unto Esther on the second day at the banquet of wine, What @9is@7 thy petition, queen Esther? and it shall be granted thee: and what @9is@7 thy request? and it shall be performed, @9even@7 to the half of the kingdom.
verse	17	7	3	Then Esther the queen answered and said, If I have found favour in thy sight, O king, and if it please the king, let my life be given me at my petition, and my people at my request:
