verse	17	7	5	Then the king Ahasuerus answered and said unto Esther the queen, Who is he, and where is he, that durst presume in his heart to do so?
verse	17	7	6	@@And Esther said, The adversary and enemy @9is@7 this wicked Haman. Then Haman was afraid before the king and the queen.
