verse	17	7	8	@@Then the king returned out of the palace garden into the place of the banquet of wine; and Haman was fallen upon the bed whereon Esther @9was.@7 Then said the king, Will he force the queen also before me in the house? As the word went out of the king's mouth, they covered Haman's face.
