verse	17	9	23	And the Jews undertook to do as they had begun, and as Mordecai had written unto them;
verse	17	9	24	@@Because Haman the son of Hammedatha, the Agagite, the enemy of all the Jews, had devised against the Jews to destroy them, and had cast Pur, that @9is,@7 the lot, to consume them, and to destroy them;
verse	17	9	25	@@But when @9Esther@7 came before the king, he commanded by letters that his wicked device, which he devised against the Jews, should return upon his own head, and that he and his sons should be hanged on the gallows.
verse	17	9	26	@@Wherefore they called these days Purim after the name of Pur. Therefore for all the words of this letter, and @9of that@7 which they had seen concerning this matter, and which had come unto them,
