verse	18	1	11	But put forth thine hand now, and touch all that he hath, and he will curse thee to thy face.
verse	18	1	12	@@And the LORD said unto Satan, Behold, all that he hath @9is@7 in thy power; only upon himself put not forth thine hand. So Satan went forth from the presence of the LORD.
verse	18	1	13	@@And there was a day when his sons and his daughters @9were@7 eating and drinking wine in their eldest brother's house:
