verse	18	1	17	@@While he @9was@7 yet speaking, there came also another, and said, The Chaldeans made out three bands, and fell upon the camels, and have carried them away, yea, and slain the servants with the edge of the sword; and I only am escaped alone to tell thee.
verse	18	1	18	@@While he @9was@7 yet speaking, there came also another, and said, Thy sons and thy daughters @9were@7 eating and drinking wine in their eldest brother's house:
