verse	18	3	1	After this opened Job his mouth, and cursed his day.
verse	18	3	2	And Job spake, and said,
verse	18	3	3	@@Let the day perish wherein I was born, and the night @9in which@7 it was said, There is a man child conceived.
verse	18	3	4	Let that day be darkness; let not God regard it from above, neither let the light shine upon it.
verse	18	3	5	Let darkness and the shadow of death stain it; let a cloud dwell upon it; let the blackness of the day terrify it.
