verse	18	3	19	@@The small and great are there; and the servant @9is@7 free from his master.
verse	18	3	20	@@Wherefore is light given to him that is in misery, and life unto the bitter @9in@7 soul;
verse	18	3	21	@@Which long for death, but it @9cometh@7 not; and dig for it more than for hid treasures;
verse	18	3	22	@@Which rejoice exceedingly, @9and@7 are glad, when they can find the grave?
verse	18	3	23	@@@9Why is light given@7 to a man whose way is hid, and whom God hath hedged in?
verse	18	3	24	For my sighing cometh before I eat, and my roarings are poured out like the waters.
