verse	18	4	3	Behold, thou hast instructed many, and thou hast strengthened the weak hands.
verse	18	4	4	Thy words have upholden him that was falling, and thou hast strengthened the feeble knees.
verse	18	4	5	But now it is come upon thee, and thou faintest; it toucheth thee, and thou art troubled.
