verse	23	45	1	Thus saith the LORD to his anointed, to Cyrus, whose right hand I have holden, to subdue nations before him; and I will loose the loins of kings, to open before him the two leaved gates; and the gates shall not be shut;
verse	23	45	2	I will go before thee, and make the crooked places straight: I will break in pieces the gates of brass, and cut in sunder the bars of iron:
verse	23	45	3	@@And I will give thee the treasures of darkness, and hidden riches of secret places, that thou mayest know that I, the LORD, which call @9thee@7 by thy name, @9am@7 the God of Israel.
