verse	23	45	8	Drop down, ye heavens, from above, and let the skies pour down righteousness: let the earth open, and let them bring forth salvation, and let righteousness spring up together; I the LORD have created it.
verse	23	45	9	@@Woe unto him that striveth with his Maker! @9Let@7 the potsherd @9strive@7 with the potsherds of the earth. Shall the clay say to him that fashioneth it, What makest thou? or thy work, He hath no hands?
