verse	24	7	28	@@But thou shalt say unto them, This @9is@7 a nation that obeyeth not the voice of the LORD their God, nor receiveth correction: truth is perished, and is cut off from their mouth.
verse	24	7	29	@@Cut off thine hair, @9O Jerusalem,@7 and cast @9it@7 away, and take up a lamentation on high places; for the LORD hath rejected and forsaken the generation of his wrath.
