verse	24	10	5	@@They @9are@7 upright as the palm tree, but speak not: they must needs be borne, because they cannot go. Be not afraid of them; for they cannot do evil, neither also @9is it@7 in them to do good.
verse	24	10	6	@@Forasmuch as @9there is@7 none like unto thee, O LORD; thou @9art@7 great, and thy name is great in might.
