verse	24	10	10	@@But the LORD @9is@7 the true God, he @9is@7 the living God, and an everlasting king: at his wrath the earth shall tremble, and the nations shall not be able to abide his indignation.
verse	24	10	11	@@Thus shall ye say unto them, The gods that have not made the heavens and the earth, @9even@7 they shall perish from the earth, and from under these heavens.
