verse	24	10	13	@@When he uttereth his voice, @9there is@7 a multitude of waters in the heavens, and he causeth the vapors to ascend from the ends of the earth; he maketh lightnings with rain, and bringeth forth the wind out of his treasures.
verse	24	10	14	@@Every man is brutish in @9his@7 knowledge: every founder is confounded by the graven image: for his molten image is falsehood, and @9there is@7 no breath in them.
