verse	24	12	1	@@Righteous @9art@7 thou, O LORD, when I plead with thee: yet let me talk with thee of @9thy@7 judgments: Wherefore doth the way of the wicked prosper? @9wherefore@7 are all they happy that deal very treacherously?
verse	24	12	2	@@Thou hast planted them, yea, they have taken root: they grow, yea, they bring forth fruit: thou @9art@7 near in their mouth, and far from their reins.
verse	24	12	3	But thou, O LORD, knowest me: thou hast seen me, and tried mine heart toward thee: pull them out like sheep for the slaughter, and prepare them for the day of slaughter.
