verse	24	16	10	@@And it shall come to pass, when thou shalt shew this people all these words, and they shall say unto thee, Wherefore hath the LORD pronounced all this great evil against us? or what @9is@7 our iniquity? or what @9is@7 our sin that we have committed against the LORD our God?
