verse	24	45	1	The word that Jeremiah the prophet spake unto Baruch the son of Neriah, when he had written these words in a book at the mouth of Jeremiah, in the fourth year of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah, saying,
verse	24	45	2	Thus saith the LORD, the God of Israel, unto thee, O Baruch;
