verse	24	45	4	@@Thus shalt thou say unto him, The LORD saith thus; Behold, @9that@7 which I have built will I break down, and that which I have planted I will pluck up, even this whole land.
verse	24	45	5	@@And seekest thou great things for thyself? seek @9them@7 not: for, behold, I will bring evil upon all flesh, saith the LORD: but thy life will I give unto thee for a prey in all places whither thou goest.
verse	24	46	1	The word of the LORD which came to Jeremiah the prophet against the Gentiles;
