verse	24	46	10	@@For this @9is@7 the day of the Lord GOD of hosts, a day of vengeance, that he may avenge him of his adversaries: and the sword shall devour, and it shall be satiate and made drunk with their blood: for the Lord GOD of hosts hath a sacrifice in the north country by the river Euphrates.
verse	24	46	11	@@Go up into Gilead, and take balm, O virgin, the daughter of Egypt: in vain shalt thou use many medicines; @9for@7 thou shalt not be cured.
