verse	24	46	17	@@They did cry there, Pharaoh king of Egypt @9is but@7 a noise; he hath passed the time appointed.
verse	24	46	18	@@@9As@7 I live, saith the King, whose name @9is@7 the LORD of hosts, Surely as Tabor @9is@7 among the mountains, and as Carmel by the sea, @9so@7 shall he come.
