verse	24	47	2	Thus saith the LORD; Behold, waters rise up out of the north, and shall be an overflowing flood, and shall overflow the land, and all that is therein; the city, and them that dwell therein: then the men shall cry, and all the inhabitants of the land shall howl.
verse	24	47	3	@@At the noise of the stamping of the hoofs of his strong @9horses,@7 at the rushing of his chariots, @9and at@7 the rumbling of his wheels, the fathers shall not look back to @9their@7 children for feebleness of hands;
verse	24	47	4	@@Because of the day that cometh to spoil all the Philistines, @9and@7 to cut off from Tyrus and Zidon every helper that remaineth: for the LORD will spoil the Philistines, the remnant of the country of Caphtor.
