verse	24	48	1	@@Against Moab thus saith the LORD of hosts, the God of Israel; Woe unto Nebo! for it is spoiled: Kiriathaim is confounded @9and@7 taken: Misgab is confounded and dismayed.
verse	24	48	2	@@@9There shall be@7 no more praise of Moab: in Heshbon they have devised evil against it; come, and let us cut it off from @9being@7 a nation. Also thou shalt be cut down, O Madmen; the sword shall pursue thee.
