verse	24	48	34	@@From the cry of Heshbon @9even@7 unto Elealeh, @9and even@7 unto Jahaz, have they uttered their voice, from Zoar @9even@7 unto Horonaim, @9as@7 an heifer of three years old: for the waters also of Nimrim shall be desolate.
