verse	24	49	19	@@Behold, he shall come up like a lion from the swelling of Jordan against the habitation of the strong: but I will suddenly make him run away from her: and who @9is@7 a chosen @9man, that@7 I may appoint over her? for who @9is@7 like me? and who will appoint me the time? and who @9is@7 that shepherd that will stand before me?
verse	24	49	20	Therefore hear the counsel of the LORD, that he hath taken against Edom; and his purposes, that he hath purposed against the inhabitants of Teman: Surely the least of the flock shall draw them out: surely he shall make their habitations desolate with them.
