verse	24	51	57	@@And I will make drunk her princes, and her wise @9men,@7 her captains, and her rulers, and her mighty men: and they shall sleep a perpetual sleep, and not wake, saith the King, whose name @9is@7 the LORD of hosts.
verse	24	51	58	Thus saith the LORD of hosts; The broad walls of Babylon shall be utterly broken, and her high gates shall be burned with fire; and the people shall labour in vain, and the folk in the fire, and they shall be weary.
