verse	26	22	8	Thou hast despised mine holy things, and hast profaned my sabbaths.
verse	26	22	9	In thee are men that carry tales to shed blood: and in thee they eat upon the mountains: in the midst of thee they commit lewdness.
verse	26	22	10	In thee have they discovered their fathers' nakedness: in thee have they humbled her that was set apart for pollution.
verse	26	22	11	And one hath committed abomination with his neighbour's wife; and another hath lewdly defiled his daughter in law; and another in thee hath humbled his sister, his father's daughter.
verse	26	22	12	In thee have they taken gifts to shed blood; thou hast taken usury and increase, and thou hast greedily gained of thy neighbours by extortion, and hast forgotten me, saith the Lord GOD.
