verse	26	41	18	@@And @9it was@7 made with cherubims and palm trees, so that a palm tree @9was@7 between a cherub and a cherub; and @9every@7 cherub had two faces;
verse	26	41	19	@@So that the face of a man @9was@7 toward the palm tree on the one side, and the face of a young lion toward the palm tree on the other side: @9it was@7 made through all the house round about.
verse	26	41	20	@@From the ground unto above the door @9were@7 cherubims and palm trees made, and @9on@7 the wall of the temple.
