verse	26	41	22	@@The altar of wood @9was@7 three cubits high, and the length thereof two cubits; and the corners thereof, and the length thereof, and the walls thereof, @9were@7 of wood: and he said unto me, This @9is@7 the table that @9is@7 before the LORD.
verse	26	41	23	And the temple and the sanctuary had two doors.
verse	26	41	24	@@And the doors had two leaves @9apiece,@7 two turning leaves; two @9leaves@7 for the one door, and two leaves for the other @9door. @7
verse	26	41	25	@@And @9there were@7 made on them, on the doors of the temple, cherubims and palm trees, like as @9were@7 made upon the walls; and @9there were@7 thick planks upon the face of the porch without.
verse	26	41	26	@@And @9there were@7 narrow windows and palm trees on the one side and on the other side, on the sides of the porch, and @9upon@7 the side chambers of the house, and thick planks.
verse	26	42	1	@@Then he brought me forth into the utter court, the way toward the north: and he brought me into the chamber that @9was@7 over against the separate place, and which @9was@7 before the building toward the north.
verse	26	42	2	@@Before the length of an hundred cubits @9was@7 the north door, and the breadth @9was@7 fifty cubits.
verse	26	42	3	@@Over against the twenty @9cubits@7 which @9were@7 for the inner court, and over against the pavement which @9was@7 for the utter court, @9was@7 gallery against gallery in three @9stories. @7
verse	26	42	4	@@And before the chambers @9was@7 a walk of ten cubits breadth inward, a way of one cubit; and their doors toward the north.
verse	26	42	5	@@Now the upper chambers @9were@7 shorter: for the galleries were higher than these, than the lower, and than the middlemost of the building.
