verse	27	11	17	@@He shall also set his face to enter with the strength of his whole kingdom, and upright ones with him; thus shall he do: and he shall give him the daughter of women, corrupting her: but she shall not stand @9on his side,@7 neither be for him.
verse	27	11	18	@@After this shall he turn his face unto the isles, and shall take many: but a prince for his own behalf shall cause the reproach offered by him to cease; without his own reproach he shall cause @9it@7 to turn upon him.
verse	27	11	19	Then he shall turn his face toward the fort of his own land: but he shall stumble and fall, and not be found.
verse	27	11	20	@@Then shall stand up in his estate a raiser of taxes @9in@7 the glory of the kingdom: but within few days he shall be destroyed, neither in anger, nor in battle.
