verse	27	11	22	And with the arms of a flood shall they be overflown from before him, and shall be broken; yea, also the prince of the covenant.
verse	27	11	23	@@And after the league @9made@7 with him he shall work deceitfully: for he shall come up, and shall become strong with a small people.
verse	27	11	24	@@He shall enter peaceably even upon the fattest places of the province; and he shall do @9that@7 which his fathers have not done, nor his fathers' fathers; he shall scatter among them the prey, and spoil, and riches: @9yea,@7 and he shall forecast his devices against the strong holds, even for a time.
verse	27	11	25	And he shall stir up his power and his courage against the king of the south with a great army; and the king of the south shall be stirred up to battle with a very great and mighty army; but he shall not stand: for they shall forecast devices against him.
