verse	27	12	1	@@And at that time shall Michael stand up, the great prince which standeth for the children of thy people: and there shall be a time of trouble, such as never was since there was a nation @9even@7 to that same time: and at that time thy people shall be delivered, every one that shall be found written in the book.
