verse	28	2	5	@@For their mother hath played the harlot: she that conceived them hath done shamefully: for she said, I will go after my lovers, that give @9me@7 my bread and my water, my wool and my flax, mine oil and my drink.
verse	28	2	6	Therefore, behold, I will hedge up thy way with thorns, and make a wall, that she shall not find her paths.
verse	28	2	7	@@And she shall follow after her lovers, but she shall not overtake them; and she shall seek them, but shall not find @9them:@7 then shall she say, I will go and return to my first husband; for then @9was it@7 better with me than now.
